{"type":"message","id":"8dd8aa80","parentId":"59ed426e","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:02:42.558Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-15 00:02:39 UTC] Feishu[default] group oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75 | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52d91716713cb2d069b24f6915c, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d91716713cb2d069b24f6915c\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-15 00:02 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n我要引入或者制作德胧酒店集团目前想要测试采购维度的一个AI工具，我的想法是现在网络的社会下，所有的价格基本都透明的，所有产品的生产成本很容易去剥离品牌溢价的成本，原材料成本，加上开模和人工生产制造这些租金，水电管包括品牌宣传的费用就同意剥离了，那么理论上一个产品的原材料的成本其实是很低的，那么这样的我们就可以一层一层的去算出来每个产品的成本价格就作为一个采购底线，那么我们可以在这个成本价格基础之上给他加一定的利润空间，那我想着你们能不能帮我找到这个开源的工具？skill？就是类似于所有物品采购成本价格的判断的一个参考工具，这样的就是我们在有任何去采购的时候就有一个辅助的判断底线，麻烦你们牵头搞一下调研，ai启动写作机制"}],"timestamp":1776211362506}}
{"type":"message","id":"8ae58d27","parentId":"8dd8aa80","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:02:56.181Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户是晁留柱，他想要找或制作一个AI工具来帮助德胧酒店集团进行采购成本分析和价格判断。\n\n核心需求：\n1. 剥离产品成本：原材料成本 + 生产制造成本（开模、人工、租金、水电）+ 品牌溢价\n2. 计算出成本价格作为采购底线\n3. 在成本基础上加利润空间\n4. 作为采购决策的参考工具\n\n他要求：\n1. 先搜索开源工具\n2. 如果没有合适的，再考虑自研\n3. 启动AI写作机制输出调研报告\n\n我需要：\n1. 先搜索开源社区（如GitHub、ClawHub）查找类似工具\n2. 搜索关键词：采购成本分析、成本计算、供应链成本、开源采购工具等\n3. 如果找到合适的，整理汇报；如果没有，评估自研方案\n\n让我先进行网络搜索。"},{"type":"text","text":"收到！小柱来搞调研了 🔍\n\n先说我的理解：\n- **目标**：建立一个\"采购成本底价参考系统\"\n- **思路**：把产品价格拆解为 原材料+生产制造+品牌溢价 → 得到真实成本 → 加合理利润 = 采购底线\n- **要求**：先找开源方案，不造轮子\n\n立刻启动搜索！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nfledwrqph33_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"开源 采购成本分析工具 供应链成本计算 GitHub"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nfledwrqph33_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"AI 采购询价比价工具 开源 酒店 供应链"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nfledwrqph33_3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"product cost breakdown tool open source BOM cost calculation"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776211362560,"responseId":"062e08a2f626a6c5b5b01d0fef8ac2ac"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3343c5af","parentId":"8ae58d27","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:02:57.498Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_nfledwrqph33_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"开源 采购成本分析工具 供应链成本计算 GitHub\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Costotus\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/donis3/react-costcalc\",\n      \"description\": \"Costotus helps you track expenses, manage materials, create recipes, and analyze your production costs—all in your browser with complete privacy.\\n🌟 Features\\n📊 Cost Analysis & Tracking\\nTrack materials, packaging, recipes, and end products\\nReal-time cost calculations as you update data\\nVisual cost breakdowns with interactive charts\\nHistorical expense tracking with trend analysis\\n🏭 Manufacturing Management\\nMaterials: Track raw materials with cost history and currency support\\nRecipes: Create production recipes with ingredients and labor...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"KiCost:轻松计算电子元件成本，优化你的硬件设计-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00084/article/details/137905604\",\n      \"description\": \"项目简介\\n是一个强大的开源工具，专为电子工程师和爱好者设计，用于自动计算电路板设计（基于KiCad、EAGLE 或其他EDA工具）中所有组件的成本。它能够快速准确地获取各大供应商的价格信息，并支持批量操作，从而帮助你在产品开发早期就对成本有清晰的预估。\\n供应链管理 - 检查元件的可用性和交货时间，选择最佳供应商。\\n版本控制 - 随着设计迭代，监控...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"💵 Supplier TCO Model\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/virbahu/supplier-tco-model\",\n      \"description\": \"<table>\\n<tr><td>virbahu</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>.gitignore</td><td>.gitignore</td><td>feat: supplier-tco-model</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>LICENSE</td><td>LICENSE</td><td>feat: supplier-tco-model</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>README.md</td><td>README.md</td><...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI HPP Calculator\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/irfan-yulianto/Kalkulator-UMKM\",\n      \"description\": \"Platform web-based untuk membantu UKM dan business owners menghitung Harga Pokok Penjualan (HPP/COGS) dengan akurat berdasarkan material cost, quantity per batch, dan target margin.\\nClone repository\\ngit clone https://github.com/your-username/hpp-calculator.git\\ncd hpp-calculator\\nInstall dependencies\\npip install -r requirements.txt\\nJalankan aplikasi\\nstreamlit run app.py\\nHPP per Unit         = Total Batch Cost ÷ Output...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Python, C ++开发全球10万种商品利润与成本结构解析APP -CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/2501_90802096/article/details/147290269\",\n      \"description\": \"- 用户可提交数据修正（ GitHub PR审核）...\\n- **桌面端**：`PyQt`嵌入C++计算模块，支持离线分析（如企业级成本敏感数据本地处理）。\\n#### **5. 开源生态集成**\\n- **依赖管理**：Python端用`poetry`，C++端用`vcpkg`。\\n- **社区协作**：通过GitHub Issues管理数据修正请求，自动化CI/CD验证数据一致性。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"300行代码搞定中小企业供应链数据分析!附可直接复用工具包-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/2402_87739606/article/details/157085084\",\n      \"description\": \"• 处理效率...\\n1. 免费获取方式\\n项目已开源，直接克隆GitHub 仓库即可：\\ngit clone https://github.com/Ai060715W/Supply-Chain-Efficiency-Analytics.git\\n• 包含文件：全部源码、数据模板、操作手册（含截图教程）、示例数据库；\\n• 适配场景：零售、中小制造、贸易类企业，可按业务需求微调参数（附调整说明）。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"采购成本管理控制快速计算器.doc-原创力文档\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.book118.com/html/2025/1112/8025063121010007.shtm\",\n      \"description\": \"步骤4：计算总成本与控制目标\\n汇总直接成本与间接成本，设定成本控制目标，形成对比分析：\\n采购总成本=（物料/服务单价+运杂费+税费+其他直接费用）×采购数量+管理费用+仓储成本+质量成本；\\n控制目标成本：基于历史最优成本、市场行情波动、降本目标等设定（如“较历史成本降低5%”“不超预算金额”）；\\n成本差异=采购总成本...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"供应链采购成本计算模板.doc-原创力文档\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.book118.com/html/2025/0912/8105102026007132.shtm\",\n      \"description\": \"（二）第一步：核算直接采购成本\\n直接采购成本是指为获取商品本身所支付的直接费用，计算公式为：\\n直接采购成本 = 采购单价 × 采购数量 × （1 - 折扣率）\\n填写采购单价与数量：在模板“直接成本明细表”中录入供应商报价单价（单位：元/个/千克等）及实际采购数量；\\n计算折扣金额：若供应商提供批量折扣、付款折扣等，需标注...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"githubdaily的微博\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.weibo.cn/detail/5257419757455651\",\n      \"description\": \"偶然看到rever这个开源财务自动化平台，定位非常精准，是一个ai驱动的财务自动化平台，或者说是我们的“虚拟cfo”。核心是把供应商管理、采购订单和账单处理整合到一起，通过二向匹配功能自动比对采购单和账单的数量金额，防止多付或错付。github：github.com/makerever/rever还内置了审批工作流和完整的审计日志，每个操作都有记录可追溯，...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"采购成本控制清单成本分析工具.doc - 人人文库\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.renrendoc.com/paper/486488830.html\",\n      \"description\": \"步骤二：收集与整理基础数据数据采集：从ERP系统导出目标物料的历史采购记录（含采购数量、单价、...\\n步骤三：拆解成本构成要素将采购成本拆解为直接成本与间接成本，明确各成本项的占比：直接成本：物料本身价格（含出厂价、包装费等）；间接成本：运输费用、仓储成本、关税、质检费、资金占用成本（按库存周转天数计算）、管理分摊费用等。\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"开源 采购成本分析工具 供应链成本计算 GitHub","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"Costotus","url":"https://github.com/donis3/react-costcalc","description":"Costotus helps you track expenses, manage materials, create recipes, and analyze your production costs—all in your browser with complete privacy.\n🌟 Features\n📊 Cost Analysis & Tracking\nTrack materials, packaging, recipes, and end products\nReal-time cost calculations as you update data\nVisual cost breakdowns with interactive charts\nHistorical expense tracking with trend analysis\n🏭 Manufacturing Management\nMaterials: Track raw materials with cost history and currency support\nRecipes: Create production recipes with ingredients and labor...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"KiCost:轻松计算电子元件成本，优化你的硬件设计-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00084/article/details/137905604","description":"项目简介\n是一个强大的开源工具，专为电子工程师和爱好者设计，用于自动计算电路板设计（基于KiCad、EAGLE 或其他EDA工具）中所有组件的成本。它能够快速准确地获取各大供应商的价格信息，并支持批量操作，从而帮助你在产品开发早期就对成本有清晰的预估。\n供应链管理 - 检查元件的可用性和交货时间，选择最佳供应商。\n版本控制 - 随着设计迭代，监控...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"💵 Supplier TCO Model","url":"https://github.com/virbahu/supplier-tco-model","description":"<table>\n<tr><td>virbahu</td></tr>\n<tr><td>.gitignore</td><td>.gitignore</td><td>feat: supplier-tco-model</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>LICENSE</td><td>LICENSE</td><td>feat: supplier-tco-model</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>README.md</td><td>README.md</td><...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"AI HPP Calculator","url":"https://github.com/irfan-yulianto/Kalkulator-UMKM","description":"Platform web-based untuk membantu UKM dan business owners menghitung Harga Pokok Penjualan (HPP/COGS) dengan akurat berdasarkan material cost, quantity per batch, dan target margin.\nClone repository\ngit clone https://github.com/your-username/hpp-calculator.git\ncd hpp-calculator\nInstall dependencies\npip install -r requirements.txt\nJalankan aplikasi\nstreamlit run app.py\nHPP per Unit         = Total Batch Cost ÷ Output...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Python, C ++开发全球10万种商品利润与成本结构解析APP -CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/2501_90802096/article/details/147290269","description":"- 用户可提交数据修正（ GitHub PR审核）...\n- **桌面端**：`PyQt`嵌入C++计算模块，支持离线分析（如企业级成本敏感数据本地处理）。\n#### **5. 开源生态集成**\n- **依赖管理**：Python端用`poetry`，C++端用`vcpkg`。\n- **社区协作**：通过GitHub Issues管理数据修正请求，自动化CI/CD验证数据一致性。\n","siteName":""},{"title":"300行代码搞定中小企业供应链数据分析!附可直接复用工具包-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/2402_87739606/article/details/157085084","description":"• 处理效率...\n1. 免费获取方式\n项目已开源，直接克隆GitHub 仓库即可：\ngit clone https://github.com/Ai060715W/Supply-Chain-Efficiency-Analytics.git\n• 包含文件：全部源码、数据模板、操作手册（含截图教程）、示例数据库；\n• 适配场景：零售、中小制造、贸易类企业，可按业务需求微调参数（附调整说明）。\n","siteName":""},{"title":"采购成本管理控制快速计算器.doc-原创力文档","url":"https://m.book118.com/html/2025/1112/8025063121010007.shtm","description":"步骤4：计算总成本与控制目标\n汇总直接成本与间接成本，设定成本控制目标，形成对比分析：\n采购总成本=（物料/服务单价+运杂费+税费+其他直接费用）×采购数量+管理费用+仓储成本+质量成本；\n控制目标成本：基于历史最优成本、市场行情波动、降本目标等设定（如“较历史成本降低5%”“不超预算金额”）；\n成本差异=采购总成本...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"供应链采购成本计算模板.doc-原创力文档","url":"https://m.book118.com/html/2025/0912/8105102026007132.shtm","description":"（二）第一步：核算直接采购成本\n直接采购成本是指为获取商品本身所支付的直接费用，计算公式为：\n直接采购成本 = 采购单价 × 采购数量 × （1 - 折扣率）\n填写采购单价与数量：在模板“直接成本明细表”中录入供应商报价单价（单位：元/个/千克等）及实际采购数量；\n计算折扣金额：若供应商提供批量折扣、付款折扣等，需标注...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"githubdaily的微博","url":"https://m.weibo.cn/detail/5257419757455651","description":"偶然看到rever这个开源财务自动化平台，定位非常精准，是一个ai驱动的财务自动化平台，或者说是我们的“虚拟cfo”。核心是把供应商管理、采购订单和账单处理整合到一起，通过二向匹配功能自动比对采购单和账单的数量金额，防止多付或错付。github：github.com/makerever/rever还内置了审批工作流和完整的审计日志，每个操作都有记录可追溯，...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"采购成本控制清单成本分析工具.doc - 人人文库","url":"https://www.renrendoc.com/paper/486488830.html","description":"步骤二：收集与整理基础数据数据采集：从ERP系统导出目标物料的历史采购记录（含采购数量、单价、...\n步骤三：拆解成本构成要素将采购成本拆解为直接成本与间接成本，明确各成本项的占比：直接成本：物料本身价格（含出厂价、包装费等）；间接成本：运输费用、仓储成本、关税、质检费、资金占用成本（按库存周转天数计算）、管理分摊费用等。","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776211377452}}
{"type":"message","id":"08974eb1","parentId":"3343c5af","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:02:57.678Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_nfledwrqph33_2","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"AI 采购询价比价工具 开源 酒店 供应链\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"酒店预订成本直降40%?，揭秘Open-AutoGLM自动比价背后的黑科技-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/Algorift/article/details/156113609\",\n      \"description\": \"Open-AutoGLM的核心机制\\n该系统通过自然语言理解自动解析客户预订意图，并调用多源库存API完成比价与锁定。其核心调度逻辑如下：\\n<代码开始> # 示例：Open-AutoGLM的请求路由逻辑def route_booking_request(user_query):    intent = nlu_model.parse(user_query)  # 解析用户意图    if intent.destination in cache.keys():        return direct_inventory_call(intent)  # 直...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI 龙虾爆火!不是美食，是采购的最强数字外挂_采供邢老师\",\n      \"url\": \"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7623032455380992539/\",\n      \"description\": \"AI 龙虾是一款本地部署、开源免费的 AI 执行工具。它像给 AI 装上 “鼠标和手”，能听懂指令、自主拆任务、跨软件操作，不用人工值守就能完成一系列工作。\\n最大亮点:数据不上云、隐私更安全，特别适配采购行业敏感信息处理需求。\\n自动抓取多平台报价、资质、产能、运费，一键生成比价表，智能推荐 TOP3 供应商。\\n人工 1 天...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"1688 BAPI 实时询价比价技术解析:驱动智能采购决策-阿里云开发者社区\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.aliyun.com/article/1696924\",\n      \"description\": \"简介： 1688开放平台实时询价比价API重构B2B采购流程，通过动态询价引擎、多目标比价算法与智能预警系统，实现秒级响应、精准决策。支持并发请求、帕累托优化与价格波动预测，集成Python调用示例，助力企业采购周期缩短至5分钟内，决策错误率下降62%，服务超23万商家，日均处理200万+请求，推动供应链高效数字化转型...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI赋能采购革命:OpenClaw自动化比价工具重塑企业采购新范式，实现采购比价与供应商评估自动化! - 企小谋\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.qixiaomou.com/ai/421.html\",\n      \"description\": \"核心原理：像审计师一样“抠字眼”\\nOpenClaw不只是简单的OCR（文字识别）工具，它具备“理解商业条款”的能力。\\n1. 结构还原\\nOpenClaw能识别文档中的表格、页眉页脚，哪怕跨页表格也能自动拼接。这意味着，无论供应商的报价单格式多么复杂，OpenClaw都能准确地还原其结构。\\n2. 语义对齐\\nOpenClaw能...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"你还在手动比价?，Open-AutoGLM一键实现全网酒店最低价锁定-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/LearnPlex/article/details/156113691\",\n      \"description\": \"在数字化时代，旅行者不再满足于逐个平台比对酒店价格的低效方式。Open-AutoGLM 作为一款基于大语言模型与自动化工作流的开源工具，正在彻底改变酒店预订的决策流程。它能够自动抓取主流预订平台的实时房价、房型信息，并结合用户偏好进行智能推荐，极大提升了比价效率和决策质量。\\nOpen-AutoGLM 的核心在于其自动化数据采集与语义理解能力。系统将解析需求并调度...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI- Powered Procurement Solution for Multi-Property Hospitality Chains\",\n      \"url\": \"https://proqsmart.com/hospitality-chains/\",\n      \"description\": \"Transform Hospitality Procurement from Complex Challenge to Competitive Advantage\\nProQsmart empowers hotel chains, resorts, and hospitality groups to streamline procurement, renovation, and asset management across multiple properties.\\nReverse Auction\\nCompetitive pricing, reduced costs, & increased transparency.\\nAl enhances procurement through:• Predictive cost analysis• Intelligent supplier recommendations• Real-time market trend insights• Automated risk assessment• Performance benchmarking across properties• Dynamic pricing strategies\\nWhat cost and time savings can a hospitality chain expect from implementing a procurement...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"3步选对智能预订系统省30%差旅费-阿里商旅\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.alibtrip.com/document/3020835\",\n      \"description\": \"阿里商旅智能预订系统通过AI算法实时比价，结合住宿质量监控与用户评价管理，助力企业年度差旅成本降低30%。作为升级自飞猪企业版的品牌，阿里商旅凭借阿里巴巴的生态资源，创建了行业首个结合OTA数据与协议酒店...\\n通过API直连超过20万家酒店资源，实现毫秒级的价格比对响应。\\n整合飞猪、携程等多个平台的实时价格，并结合企业历史消费数据建立价格模型。\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"商旅酒店资源整合6大平台优化策略-阿里商旅\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.alibtrip.com/document/3015326\",\n      \"description\": \"该系统集成了携程商旅、同程商旅等六大平台的数据接口，并在三秒内生成全面的比价报告。某科技公司利用这一功能发现某五星级酒店的协议价格竟然比市场价高出28%，从而每年节省了470万元的差旅费用 。\\n该系统通过企业的历史预订数据和员工偏好，利用AI技术自动筛选符合政策的三个最佳酒店选项。某外资企业使用后，员工自主选择合规酒店的...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"甄云科技-采购管理系统-SRM平台-询价管理系统-供应商管理软件\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.going-link.com\",\n      \"description\": \"智慧寻源\\n覆盖企业所有定价行为，支撑您更高效的定商定价，综合降本\\n多种寻源方案组合，适配更多寻源场景；\\n智能采购价格管理工具，综合管控TOC;\\n整合海量平台供应商，拓展寻源空间；\\n电子化的采购合同管理，高效便捷。\\n智慧寻源\\n覆盖企业所有定价行为，支撑您更高效的定商定价，综合降本\\n多种寻源方案组合，适配更多寻...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI智能全网比价:鲸采云助力企业数字化转型_采购_数据_系统\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.sohu.com/a/968772510_122540649/\",\n      \"description\": \"采购成本是企业运营成本的重要组成部分，而比价环节则是成本控制的关键。鲸采云依托先进的 AI 技术，构建智能全网比价引擎，彻底改变了传统人工比价的粗放模式。系统接入全网优质供应商资源，涵盖设备、原料、五金、信息服务等多个品类，当企业发起采购需求后，AI 算法可自动抓取不同供应商的报价信息，进行多维度比对分析。\\n无论是产品规格、价格高低、...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"AI 采购询价比价工具 开源 酒店 供应链","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"酒店预订成本直降40%?，揭秘Open-AutoGLM自动比价背后的黑科技-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/Algorift/article/details/156113609","description":"Open-AutoGLM的核心机制\n该系统通过自然语言理解自动解析客户预订意图，并调用多源库存API完成比价与锁定。其核心调度逻辑如下：\n<代码开始> # 示例：Open-AutoGLM的请求路由逻辑def route_booking_request(user_query):    intent = nlu_model.parse(user_query)  # 解析用户意图    if intent.destination in cache.keys():        return direct_inventory_call(intent)  # 直...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"AI 龙虾爆火!不是美食，是采购的最强数字外挂_采供邢老师","url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7623032455380992539/","description":"AI 龙虾是一款本地部署、开源免费的 AI 执行工具。它像给 AI 装上 “鼠标和手”，能听懂指令、自主拆任务、跨软件操作，不用人工值守就能完成一系列工作。\n最大亮点:数据不上云、隐私更安全，特别适配采购行业敏感信息处理需求。\n自动抓取多平台报价、资质、产能、运费，一键生成比价表，智能推荐 TOP3 供应商。\n人工 1 天...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"1688 BAPI 实时询价比价技术解析:驱动智能采购决策-阿里云开发者社区","url":"https://developer.aliyun.com/article/1696924","description":"简介： 1688开放平台实时询价比价API重构B2B采购流程，通过动态询价引擎、多目标比价算法与智能预警系统，实现秒级响应、精准决策。支持并发请求、帕累托优化与价格波动预测，集成Python调用示例，助力企业采购周期缩短至5分钟内，决策错误率下降62%，服务超23万商家，日均处理200万+请求，推动供应链高效数字化转型...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"AI赋能采购革命:OpenClaw自动化比价工具重塑企业采购新范式，实现采购比价与供应商评估自动化! - 企小谋","url":"https://www.qixiaomou.com/ai/421.html","description":"核心原理：像审计师一样“抠字眼”\nOpenClaw不只是简单的OCR（文字识别）工具，它具备“理解商业条款”的能力。\n1. 结构还原\nOpenClaw能识别文档中的表格、页眉页脚，哪怕跨页表格也能自动拼接。这意味着，无论供应商的报价单格式多么复杂，OpenClaw都能准确地还原其结构。\n2. 语义对齐\nOpenClaw能...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"你还在手动比价?，Open-AutoGLM一键实现全网酒店最低价锁定-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/LearnPlex/article/details/156113691","description":"在数字化时代，旅行者不再满足于逐个平台比对酒店价格的低效方式。Open-AutoGLM 作为一款基于大语言模型与自动化工作流的开源工具，正在彻底改变酒店预订的决策流程。它能够自动抓取主流预订平台的实时房价、房型信息，并结合用户偏好进行智能推荐，极大提升了比价效率和决策质量。\nOpen-AutoGLM 的核心在于其自动化数据采集与语义理解能力。系统将解析需求并调度...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"AI- Powered Procurement Solution for Multi-Property Hospitality Chains","url":"https://proqsmart.com/hospitality-chains/","description":"Transform Hospitality Procurement from Complex Challenge to Competitive Advantage\nProQsmart empowers hotel chains, resorts, and hospitality groups to streamline procurement, renovation, and asset management across multiple properties.\nReverse Auction\nCompetitive pricing, reduced costs, & increased transparency.\nAl enhances procurement through:• Predictive cost analysis• Intelligent supplier recommendations• Real-time market trend insights• Automated risk assessment• Performance benchmarking across properties• Dynamic pricing strategies\nWhat cost and time savings can a hospitality chain expect from implementing a procurement...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"3步选对智能预订系统省30%差旅费-阿里商旅","url":"https://www.alibtrip.com/document/3020835","description":"阿里商旅智能预订系统通过AI算法实时比价，结合住宿质量监控与用户评价管理，助力企业年度差旅成本降低30%。作为升级自飞猪企业版的品牌，阿里商旅凭借阿里巴巴的生态资源，创建了行业首个结合OTA数据与协议酒店...\n通过API直连超过20万家酒店资源，实现毫秒级的价格比对响应。\n整合飞猪、携程等多个平台的实时价格，并结合企业历史消费数据建立价格模型。","siteName":""},{"title":"商旅酒店资源整合6大平台优化策略-阿里商旅","url":"https://www.alibtrip.com/document/3015326","description":"该系统集成了携程商旅、同程商旅等六大平台的数据接口，并在三秒内生成全面的比价报告。某科技公司利用这一功能发现某五星级酒店的协议价格竟然比市场价高出28%，从而每年节省了470万元的差旅费用 。\n该系统通过企业的历史预订数据和员工偏好，利用AI技术自动筛选符合政策的三个最佳酒店选项。某外资企业使用后，员工自主选择合规酒店的...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"甄云科技-采购管理系统-SRM平台-询价管理系统-供应商管理软件","url":"https://www.going-link.com","description":"智慧寻源\n覆盖企业所有定价行为，支撑您更高效的定商定价，综合降本\n多种寻源方案组合，适配更多寻源场景；\n智能采购价格管理工具，综合管控TOC;\n整合海量平台供应商，拓展寻源空间；\n电子化的采购合同管理，高效便捷。\n智慧寻源\n覆盖企业所有定价行为，支撑您更高效的定商定价，综合降本\n多种寻源方案组合，适配更多寻...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"AI智能全网比价:鲸采云助力企业数字化转型_采购_数据_系统","url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/968772510_122540649/","description":"采购成本是企业运营成本的重要组成部分，而比价环节则是成本控制的关键。鲸采云依托先进的 AI 技术，构建智能全网比价引擎，彻底改变了传统人工比价的粗放模式。系统接入全网优质供应商资源，涵盖设备、原料、五金、信息服务等多个品类，当企业发起采购需求后，AI 算法可自动抓取不同供应商的报价信息，进行多维度比对分析。\n无论是产品规格、价格高低、...\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776211377636}}
{"type":"message","id":"954c236c","parentId":"08974eb1","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:02:58.419Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_nfledwrqph33_3","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"product cost breakdown tool open source BOM cost calculation\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"KiCost:智能化电子设计成本管理一体化解决方案-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00010/article/details/155638235\",\n      \"description\": \"KiCost作为一款专为电子工程师打造的开源成本管理工具，通过智能化技术实现了从设计到采购的全流程成本优化，让硬件开发者能够专注于技术创新而非繁琐的成本计算...\\n智能BOM解析引擎\\n深度兼容主流EDA工具，支持KiCad、Altium、Upverter等设计平台的文件格式\\n自动提取元器件规格参数、封装类型、数量等关键信息\\n多格式支持：XML、CSV等BOM文件的无缝对接\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Advanced BOM Features (Formulas)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://help.openbom.com/process/design/advanced-bom-features-formulas/\",\n      \"description\": \"Formulas are powerful tools that enable you to perform calculations and analyses within catalogs and BOMs. They help you derive values based on predefined rules, making it easier to automate processes and ensure accuracy in your data....\\nFirst, we calculate the cost for each sub-level item using the usual formula. Then, we add up these costs and include the total in the parent item’s cost. Finally, we apply the formula at the parent level. This way, we ensure all costs are accurately calculated.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Smarter Cost and Quantity Validation with Graph Analytics (Day 14 of 30)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.openbom.com/blog/smarter-cost-and-quantity-validation-with-graph-analytics-day-14-of-30\",\n      \"description\": \"OpenBOM solves this by connecting all item, cost, and quantity data through a live, multi-level graph data model, enabling automatic cost roll-ups, real-time validation, and traceable visibility across every level of the product structure. Open...\\nUsing its graph foundation, OpenBOM calculates total product costs at any level of the assembly in real time. Each node in the graph represents an item or subassembly, enriched with properties like unit cost, supplier, lead time, and procurement source.\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"@saitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator\",\n      \"url\": \"https://jsr.io/@saitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator/doc/~/ProductUnit.FD\",\n      \"description\": \"@saitodisse /bom-recipe-calculator\\n@0.5.10\\nlatest\\nsaitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator\\nA Bill of Materials (BOM) recipe calculator for nested product recipes. Calculate costs and weights for complex product recipes with multiple levels of ingredients.\\nWorks with\\nThis package works with Cloudflare Workers, Node.js, Deno, Bun, Browsers<beginning of the code>\\nimport { ProductUnit } from...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Product BOM Cost\",\n      \"url\": \"https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/15.0/eq_product_bom_cost/\",\n      \"description\": \"Product BOM Cost\\nby Equick ERP\\nOdoo\\n$10.98\\nv 15.0 Third Party 19\\n<table>\\n<tr><td> Required Apps</td><td>•Manufacturing (mrp)\\n•Inventory (stock)</td></tr>\\n<tr><td> Lines of code</td><td> 109</td></tr>\\n<tr><td> Technical Name</td><td>eq_product...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"eBOMGen\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/SayCV/ebomgen\",\n      \"description\": \"Code\\n<table>\\n<tr><td>\\nSayCV</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>.github/workflows</td><td>.github/workflows</td><td>test workflows/release.yml</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>cmd/ebomgen</td><td>cmd/ebomgen</td><td>update daily</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>pkg</td><td>pkg</...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - saitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator: A Bill of Materials (BOM) recipe calculator for nested product recipes. · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/saitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator\",\n      \"description\": \"<table>\\n<tr><td>\\nsaitodisse</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>.cursor</td><td>.cursor</td><td>test: remove redundant ground_beef test and update cheeseburger_produ…</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>.github/workflows</td><td>.github/workflows</td><td>add working-directory on Build step</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>....\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"BOM Product Costing | Auto Cost from BOM | Auto Product Cost Based on Bill of Materials\",\n      \"url\": \"https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/15.0/bi_auto_product_price\",\n      \"description\": \"Automated Calculation of Product Cost Based on Bill of Material Odoo App is designed to streamline and enhance product cost management by dynamically calculating costs based on the manufacturing Bill of Materials (BOM). This app ensures accurate cost estimation by considering all components, and raw materials involved in the manufacturing process, providing a real-time and precise product cost structure. It helps businesses maintain profitability by automatically calculating costs, eliminating manual calculations and reducing the risk of errors. This solution is particularly useful for manufacturers and production...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"WEBINAR: Organize BOMs with OpenBOM Rollups & Calculations\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.openbom.com/blog/webinar-organize-boms-with-openbom-rollups-calculations\",\n      \"description\": \"It’s risky, time-consuming, and frankly, exhausting.\\nOpenBOM Rollups and Calculations capabilities allow you to solve this problem and organize BOM structured data and perform all your critical computations into this place which is also collaborative and integrated with other systems (eg. CAD).OpenBOM solves this by keeping everything in one place. Your calculations, rollups, and BOM data live together in the same environment. No more outdated spreadsheet copies floating around. Everyone works from the same live...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Building a Simple Bill of Materials (BOM) Cost Calculator in PHP\",\n      \"url\": \"https://tools.30tools.com/blogs/mistergalactus/building-a-simple-bill-of-materials-bom-cost-calculator-in-php-3db5\",\n      \"description\": \"I wanted to create something simpler and lightweight, so I built a small Mini BOM Costing Tool using PHP.\\nWhat the Tool Does\\nThe script allows you to define a product structure using BOM components and automatically calculate the total production cost.\\nInstead of relying on databases or heavy frameworks, this tool uses simple JSON data, making it easy to modify and integrate into other systems.\\nKey Features\\nAutomatic cost calculation\\nBOM tree structure visualization\\nJSON-based data storage\\nLightweight PHP...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"product cost breakdown tool open source BOM cost calculation","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"KiCost:智能化电子设计成本管理一体化解决方案-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00010/article/details/155638235","description":"KiCost作为一款专为电子工程师打造的开源成本管理工具，通过智能化技术实现了从设计到采购的全流程成本优化，让硬件开发者能够专注于技术创新而非繁琐的成本计算...\n智能BOM解析引擎\n深度兼容主流EDA工具，支持KiCad、Altium、Upverter等设计平台的文件格式\n自动提取元器件规格参数、封装类型、数量等关键信息\n多格式支持：XML、CSV等BOM文件的无缝对接\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Advanced BOM Features (Formulas)","url":"https://help.openbom.com/process/design/advanced-bom-features-formulas/","description":"Formulas are powerful tools that enable you to perform calculations and analyses within catalogs and BOMs. They help you derive values based on predefined rules, making it easier to automate processes and ensure accuracy in your data....\nFirst, we calculate the cost for each sub-level item using the usual formula. Then, we add up these costs and include the total in the parent item’s cost. Finally, we apply the formula at the parent level. This way, we ensure all costs are accurately calculated.","siteName":""},{"title":"Smarter Cost and Quantity Validation with Graph Analytics (Day 14 of 30)","url":"https://www.openbom.com/blog/smarter-cost-and-quantity-validation-with-graph-analytics-day-14-of-30","description":"OpenBOM solves this by connecting all item, cost, and quantity data through a live, multi-level graph data model, enabling automatic cost roll-ups, real-time validation, and traceable visibility across every level of the product structure. Open...\nUsing its graph foundation, OpenBOM calculates total product costs at any level of the assembly in real time. Each node in the graph represents an item or subassembly, enriched with properties like unit cost, supplier, lead time, and procurement source.\n","siteName":""},{"title":"@saitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator","url":"https://jsr.io/@saitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator/doc/~/ProductUnit.FD","description":"@saitodisse /bom-recipe-calculator\n@0.5.10\nlatest\nsaitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator\nA Bill of Materials (BOM) recipe calculator for nested product recipes. Calculate costs and weights for complex product recipes with multiple levels of ingredients.\nWorks with\nThis package works with Cloudflare Workers, Node.js, Deno, Bun, Browsers<beginning of the code>\nimport { ProductUnit } from...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Product BOM Cost","url":"https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/15.0/eq_product_bom_cost/","description":"Product BOM Cost\nby Equick ERP\nOdoo\n$10.98\nv 15.0 Third Party 19\n<table>\n<tr><td> Required Apps</td><td>•Manufacturing (mrp)\n•Inventory (stock)</td></tr>\n<tr><td> Lines of code</td><td> 109</td></tr>\n<tr><td> Technical Name</td><td>eq_product...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"eBOMGen","url":"https://github.com/SayCV/ebomgen","description":"Code\n<table>\n<tr><td>\nSayCV</td></tr>\n<tr><td>.github/workflows</td><td>.github/workflows</td><td>test workflows/release.yml</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>cmd/ebomgen</td><td>cmd/ebomgen</td><td>update daily</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>pkg</td><td>pkg</...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - saitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator: A Bill of Materials (BOM) recipe calculator for nested product recipes. · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/saitodisse/bom-recipe-calculator","description":"<table>\n<tr><td>\nsaitodisse</td></tr>\n<tr><td>.cursor</td><td>.cursor</td><td>test: remove redundant ground_beef test and update cheeseburger_produ…</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>.github/workflows</td><td>.github/workflows</td><td>add working-directory on Build step</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>....\n","siteName":""},{"title":"BOM Product Costing | Auto Cost from BOM | Auto Product Cost Based on Bill of Materials","url":"https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/15.0/bi_auto_product_price","description":"Automated Calculation of Product Cost Based on Bill of Material Odoo App is designed to streamline and enhance product cost management by dynamically calculating costs based on the manufacturing Bill of Materials (BOM). This app ensures accurate cost estimation by considering all components, and raw materials involved in the manufacturing process, providing a real-time and precise product cost structure. It helps businesses maintain profitability by automatically calculating costs, eliminating manual calculations and reducing the risk of errors. This solution is particularly useful for manufacturers and production...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"WEBINAR: Organize BOMs with OpenBOM Rollups & Calculations","url":"https://www.openbom.com/blog/webinar-organize-boms-with-openbom-rollups-calculations","description":"It’s risky, time-consuming, and frankly, exhausting.\nOpenBOM Rollups and Calculations capabilities allow you to solve this problem and organize BOM structured data and perform all your critical computations into this place which is also collaborative and integrated with other systems (eg. CAD).OpenBOM solves this by keeping everything in one place. Your calculations, rollups, and BOM data live together in the same environment. No more outdated spreadsheet copies floating around. Everyone works from the same live...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Building a Simple Bill of Materials (BOM) Cost Calculator in PHP","url":"https://tools.30tools.com/blogs/mistergalactus/building-a-simple-bill-of-materials-bom-cost-calculator-in-php-3db5","description":"I wanted to create something simpler and lightweight, so I built a small Mini BOM Costing Tool using PHP.\nWhat the Tool Does\nThe script allows you to define a product structure using BOM components and automatically calculate the total production cost.\nInstead of relying on databases or heavy frameworks, this tool uses simple JSON data, making it easy to modify and integrate into other systems.\nKey Features\nAutomatic cost calculation\nBOM tree structure visualization\nJSON-based data storage\nLightweight PHP...\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776211378377}}
{"type":"message","id":"137b689e","parentId":"954c236c","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:03:07.338Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"搜索结果出来了，让我分析一下：\n\n**最相关的方向：**\n\n1. **Rever（GitHub: makerever/rever）** - 财务自动化平台，定位是\"虚拟CFO\"，整合供应商管理、采购订单和账单处理有二向匹配功能\n2. **OpenBOM** - 产品成本BOM计算，多级BOM成本自动汇总\n3. **bom-recipe-calculator** - 开源的BOM计算器\n4. **1688 BAPI** - 阿里1688开放平台的实时询价比价API\n5. **鲸采云** - 国内企业采购比价工具\n\n\n6. **德胧AI龙虾** - 专门针对采购行业的工具，能自动抓取多平台报价并生成比价表和TOP3推荐\n\n看起来最合适的方案是德胧AI龙虾，它本身就是为采购场景设计的，能自动抓取多平台报价。还有Rever和OpenBOM这样的开源工具可以参考。"},{"type":"text","text":"搜索结果出来了！让我继续深挖最相关的几个方向 🔎\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xdvktjmmz2tb_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"德胧AI龙虾 采购比价工具 开源"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xdvktjmmz2tb_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"1688开放平台 API 采购询价 github 开源"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xdvktjmmz2tb_3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"rever github 采购供应商账单 open source"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776211378421,"responseId":"062e08b2b8b6cc0764f29abeffb958a5"}}
{"type":"message","id":"553acda8","parentId":"137b689e","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:03:08.799Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_xdvktjmmz2tb_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"德胧AI龙虾 采购比价工具 开源\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI 龙虾爆火!不是美食，是采购的最强数字外挂_采供邢老师\",\n      \"url\": \"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7623032455380992539/\",\n      \"description\": \"AI 龙虾是一款本地部署、开源免费的 AI 执行工具。它像给 AI 装上 “鼠标和手”，能听懂指令、自主拆任务、跨软件...\\n1. 供应商寻源与比价:省时又降本\\n自动抓取多平台报价、资质、产能、运费，一键生成比价表，智能推荐 TOP3 供应商。\\n人工 1 天工作量，AI 龙虾20 分钟完成，帮助企业精准控成本。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI赋能采购革命:OpenClaw自动化比价工具重塑企业采购新范式，实现采购比价与供应商评估自动化! - 企小谋\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.qixiaomou.com/ai/421.html\",\n      \"description\": \"AI赋能采购革命：OpenClaw自动化比价工具重塑企业采购新范式，实现采购比价与供应商评估自动化！\\n推荐使用LlamaParse或Unstructured，它们对表格结构...\\n推荐GPT-4o或Claude 3.5 Sonnet。Claude 3.5在长文档（Long Context）阅读和细节提取上表现尤为出色。\\n对于简单的文本清洗，可以用Qwen-72B或 Llama 3，性价比高。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"AI龙虾大战:2026年最火的AI智能体全面横评，选对工具效率翻倍!_ai龙虾合集-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_37598243/article/details/159016581\",\n      \"description\": \"导读：2026年开年，一个被网友戏称为\\\"小龙虾\\\"的开源项目OpenCl...\\n国内外巨头纷纷入局，腾讯、字节、阿里、智谱、网易等推出各自的\\\"龙虾\\\"产品。本文深度剖析11款主流AI龙虾，帮你找到最适合的那一只！\\n随着OpenClaw的爆火，国内外巨头纷纷推出基于OpenClaw或类似架构的AI智能体产品，形成了\\\"龙虾生态圈\\\"。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"openclaw龙虾AI部署详细手册-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/qq_37614619/article/details/159125061\",\n      \"description\": \"OpenClaw（俗称 “龙虾”）是 2026 年开源 AI 领域的现象级项目，是一款开源的 AI 自动化 执行框架，其核心逻辑采用「手脑分离架构」—— 大模型负责思考决策，本地引擎负责鼠标 / 键盘 / 屏幕操作，实现 AI 自主完成电脑端全流程任务，解放双手。\\n跨平台部署对于 openclaw 龙虾 AI 来说至关重要，不同的用户...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"QQ浏览器“龙虾”AI上线!微信扫码免费使用，一键玩转智能操作_水上静泛轻舟\",\n      \"url\": \"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7626949439822807595/\",\n      \"description\": \"• 电商比价:“对比iPhone 17在淘宝、京东、拼多多的价格、优惠、发货地，生成表格”\\n自动打开多平台、搜索、抓数据、整理成表，全程不用管\\n3. 开放生态:兼容OpenClaw+自定义大模型(不绑定、不收费)\\n和其他AI浏览器最大区别:不锁死模型、完全开放。\\n• 支持混元、DeepSeek、Kimi、通义千问...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"LobsterAI(有道龙虾)官网版下载_LobsterAI本地部署_LobsterAIv网页版在线使用_华军软件园\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.onlinedown.net/soft/20270013.htm\",\n      \"description\": \"LobsterAI（有道龙虾）是网易有道推出的 “7×24小时全场景个人助理” 桌面级AI智能体，定位为 “中国版OpenClaw”。其核心目标是通过自然语言指令，让AI直接在本地计算机中执行复杂任务（如文档处理、数据分析、网页自动化等），覆盖工作、学习、创作等多场景。\\n\\n多模型支持：预置Qwen2、DeepSeek等主流大模型API，...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"腾讯云上线国内首个AI浏览器“龙虾”!一句话让浏览器自己干活_生生不息\",\n      \"url\": \"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7626679413245067795/\",\n      \"description\": \"4月8日，腾讯云正式发布国内首个浏览器“龙虾”——QBotClaw，用户只需打开QQ浏览器点击“AI”按钮，就能用一句话指挥浏览器自动完成购物比价、多平台发帖等复杂任务。这只“龙虾”不仅完全兼容OpenClaw技能，还支持自由配置国内各大主流大...\\n购物比价:自动跨平台抓取淘宝、京东、拼多多等电商数据，生成比价结果\\n内置自研QQ浏览器Skill，操作成功率高\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"政采小笔记|爆火的 OpenClaw “AI 龙虾”,正在改写政府采购全流程\",\n      \"url\": \"https://vip.chinabidding.cc/markinfo/rMvvI1XXCtGDVTST6JI..A.html\",\n      \"description\": \"OpenClaw...\\n能自主操作电脑、浏览器、办公软件\\n支持本地私有化部署，****\\n具备长期记忆，跨流程沉淀经验\\n开源框架，可定制、可监管、可审计\\n一句话：****里重复、繁琐、标准化的事，自动跑完。\\n辅助计算价格分、技术分、商务分，减少人为误差\\n全程留痕可追溯，满足审计与监管要求\\n开源可审计：代码透明，无黑箱，可做安全测评\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Untitled\",\n      \"url\": \"http://raw.githubusercontent.com/wiki/the-omics-os/lobster-local/02-installation.md\",\n      \"description\": \"# Comprehensive Installation Guide\\n\\nThis guide covers all installation methods for Lobster AI, from quick setup to advanced development configurations.\\n\\n> **⚠️ Breaking Changes in v0.4.0:**\\n> Lobster now requires explicit provider configuration via `lobster init`. Auto-detection from `.env` files has been removed.\\n>\\n# Switch back to local mode\\nunset LOBSTER_CLOUD_KEY\\nlobster chat\\n```\\n\\n**Cost Structure:**\\n- Free tier...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Untitled\",\n      \"url\": \"https://weitoutiao.zjurl.cn/rogue/topic_share/?concern_id=1792016183742515&prevent_activate=1\",\n      \"description\": \"实测数据显示，国产主流模型API价格只有海外的1/20。输入成本低至0.3美元/百万Token，海外对标产品高达5美元；输出成本最低1.1美元/百万Token，海外顶级模型要25美元，价差最大达30倍。\\n性能还对标国际一流，中文理解、多模态能力更适配国内场景。在能力接近的前提下，调用量必然快速向国产模型迁移，这不是短期趋势，...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"德胧AI龙虾 采购比价工具 开源","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"AI 龙虾爆火!不是美食，是采购的最强数字外挂_采供邢老师","url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7623032455380992539/","description":"AI 龙虾是一款本地部署、开源免费的 AI 执行工具。它像给 AI 装上 “鼠标和手”，能听懂指令、自主拆任务、跨软件...\n1. 供应商寻源与比价:省时又降本\n自动抓取多平台报价、资质、产能、运费，一键生成比价表，智能推荐 TOP3 供应商。\n人工 1 天工作量，AI 龙虾20 分钟完成，帮助企业精准控成本。\n","siteName":""},{"title":"AI赋能采购革命:OpenClaw自动化比价工具重塑企业采购新范式，实现采购比价与供应商评估自动化! - 企小谋","url":"https://www.qixiaomou.com/ai/421.html","description":"AI赋能采购革命：OpenClaw自动化比价工具重塑企业采购新范式，实现采购比价与供应商评估自动化！\n推荐使用LlamaParse或Unstructured，它们对表格结构...\n推荐GPT-4o或Claude 3.5 Sonnet。Claude 3.5在长文档（Long Context）阅读和细节提取上表现尤为出色。\n对于简单的文本清洗，可以用Qwen-72B或 Llama 3，性价比高。\n","siteName":""},{"title":"AI龙虾大战:2026年最火的AI智能体全面横评，选对工具效率翻倍!_ai龙虾合集-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_37598243/article/details/159016581","description":"导读：2026年开年，一个被网友戏称为\"小龙虾\"的开源项目OpenCl...\n国内外巨头纷纷入局，腾讯、字节、阿里、智谱、网易等推出各自的\"龙虾\"产品。本文深度剖析11款主流AI龙虾，帮你找到最适合的那一只！\n随着OpenClaw的爆火，国内外巨头纷纷推出基于OpenClaw或类似架构的AI智能体产品，形成了\"龙虾生态圈\"。\n","siteName":""},{"title":"openclaw龙虾AI部署详细手册-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/qq_37614619/article/details/159125061","description":"OpenClaw（俗称 “龙虾”）是 2026 年开源 AI 领域的现象级项目，是一款开源的 AI 自动化 执行框架，其核心逻辑采用「手脑分离架构」—— 大模型负责思考决策，本地引擎负责鼠标 / 键盘 / 屏幕操作，实现 AI 自主完成电脑端全流程任务，解放双手。\n跨平台部署对于 openclaw 龙虾 AI 来说至关重要，不同的用户...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"QQ浏览器“龙虾”AI上线!微信扫码免费使用，一键玩转智能操作_水上静泛轻舟","url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7626949439822807595/","description"