{"type":"message","id":"e1a4d3e5","parentId":"554d4fd5","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:05:03.785Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"报告写好了，现在回复小柱。"},{"type":"text","text":"调研完成！报告已沉淀至 `kb/采购成本底线参考系统调研报告.md`\n\n---\n\n**核心结论先说**：\n\n**小柱你提的这个思路非常清晰——用成本拆解代替品牌溢价采购**。这类工具目前没有\"开箱即用\"的开源产品，但有 **可组装的核心组件**。\n\n### 🔥 最值得直接用的（2个P0）\n\n| 工具 | 干什么 | 为什么推荐 |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| **1688开放平台API** | 实时查批发价、历史价格趋势 | 德胧80%物资在1688有货，**核心数据底座** |\n| **Rever（GitHub开源）** | 采购订单 vs 账单\"二向匹配\" | 防止供应商虚报，已开源可用 |\n\n### 📐 推荐架构（三层）\n\n```\n数据层：1688 API → 历史价格库\n     ↓\n分析层：AI成本拆解（BOM公式 + 大模型估算）\n     ↓\n应用层：飞书多维表格（品类基准库 + 预警）\n```\n\n### 🚧 实施路径建议\n\n**Phase 1（第1-2周）**：接1688 API → 飞书表格建品类基准价\n**Phase 2（第2-3周）**：AI成本拆解Skill（输入产品名称/图片 → 输出成本底线）\n**Phase 3（第3-4周）**：偏离预警 + 供应商报价单AI解析\n\n### ⚠️ 坦诚说\n\n你这个思路适合**标准品**（布草、一次性用品、餐饮原料），成本透明度高。**定制品/工程类**（定制家具、装修材料）品牌溢价拆解难度大，不建议强求。\n\n---\n\n报告里有完整方案和GitHub链接，要深入做哪个方向？\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776211489182,"responseId":"062e0921e5e6831d3cba4a7b4e250c76"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f44b1788","parentId":"e1a4d3e5","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:15:39.054Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-15 00:15:37 UTC] Feishu[default] group oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75 | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52d9c4b45530b28411fb0d11b8e, reply_to:om_x100b52d92df114acb2691ae7c4d3dad, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d9c4b45530b28411fb0d11b8e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-15 00:15 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[message_id=om_x100b52d92df114acb2691ae7c4d3dad] <card>\\n调研完成！报告已沉淀至 `kb/采购成本底线参考系统调研报告.md`---**核心结论先说**：\\n\\n**小柱你提的这个思路非常清晰——用成本拆解代替品牌溢价采购**。这类工具目前没有\\\"开箱即用\\\"的开源产品，但有 **可组装的核心组件**。##### 🔥 最值得直接用的（2个P0）\\n| 工具 | 干什么 | 为什么推荐 |\\n|------|------|------|\\n| 1688开放平台API | 实时查批发价、历史价格趋势 | 德胧80%物资在1688有货，核心数据底座 |\\n| Rever（GitHub开源） | 采购订单 vs 账单\\\"二向匹配\\\" | 防止供应商虚报，已开源可用 |##### 📐 推荐架构（三层）```plain_text\\n数据层：1688 API → 历史价格库     ↓分析层：AI成本拆解（BOM公式 + 大模型估算）     ↓应用层：飞书多维表格（品类基准库 + 预警）```\\n##### 🚧 实施路径建议**Phase 1（第1-2周）**：接1688 API → 飞书表格建品类基准价\\n**Phase 2（第2-3周）**：AI成本拆解Skill（输入产品名称/图片 → 输出成本底线）\\n**Phase 3（第3-4周）**：偏离预警 + 供应商报价单AI解析##### ⚠️ 坦诚说你这个思路适合**标准品**（布草、一次性用品、餐饮原料），成本透明度高。**定制品/工程类**（定制家具、装修材料）品牌溢价拆解难度大，不建议强求。---报告里有完整方案和GitHub链接，要深入做哪个方向？\\n\\n🦞\\n</card>\"\n}\n```\n\n单独立项，立即引入研究，1688有没有开源的mcp？ cli？ 这样的话一天就可以解决。"}],"timestamp":1776212139002}}
{"type":"message","id":"7bb82625","parentId":"f44b1788","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:15:45.188Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"小柱要求立刻立项研究1688开源MCP/CLI工具，说一天就可以解决。我需要快速搜索找有没有现成的1688 MCP服务器或CLI工具，然后尽快给他结论和下一步。\n\nLet me search specifically for 1688 MCP (Model Context Protocol) and CLI tools."},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 立刻查！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kme9zajubfwm_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"1688 MCP server github model context protocol"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kme9zajubfwm_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"1688 CLI 命令行工具 github 开源"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kme9zajubfwm_3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"openclaw 1688 MCP skill 采购"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776212139055,"responseId":"062e0bab592132754af1408a18c59120"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c7933981","parentId":"7bb82625","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:15:46.765Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_kme9zajubfwm_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"1688 MCP server github model context protocol\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"About Model Context Protocol (MCP)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/using-github-copilot/using-extensions-to-integrate-external-tools-with-copilot-chat\",\n      \"description\": \"You can also use MCP to create new tools and services that work with Copilot Chat, allowing you to customize and enhance your experience.\\nFor more information on MCP, see the official MCP documentation. For information on currently available MCP servers,...\\nSupport for remote MCP servers is growing, with editors like Visual Studio Code, Visual Studio, JetBrains IDEs, Xcode, Eclipse, and Cursor providing this functionality with OAuth or PAT, and Windsurf supporting PAT only.\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Sobre o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.github.com/pt/copilot/concepts/context/mcp\",\n      \"description\": \"O MCP (Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo) é um protocolo que permite estender os recursos do GitHub Copilot integrando...\\nO MCP (Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo) é um padrão aberto que define como os aplicativos compartilham contexto com os LLMs (modelos de linguagem grande). O MCP fornece um modo padronizado de conectar modelos de IA a diferentes fontes de dados e ferramentas,\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"modelcontextprotocol/docs/specification/draft/basic/index.mdx at main · modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/blob/main/docs/specification/draft/basic/index.mdx\",\n      \"description\": \"Server Features: Resources, prompts, and tools exposed by servers\\nClient Features: Sampling and root directory lists provided by clients\\nUtilities: Cross-cutting concerns like logging and argument completion\\nAll implementations MUST support the base protocol and lifecycle management components. Other components MAY be implemented based on the specific needs of the application.\\nThese protocol layers establish clear separation of concerns while enabling rich interactions between clients and servers. The modular design allows implementations to support exactly the features they need.\\nMessages\\nError...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Protocole MCP (Model Context Protocol) et assistant de codage GitHub Copilot\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.github.com/fr/copilot/concepts/agents/coding-agent/mcp-and-coding-agent\",\n      \"description\": \"The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open standard that defines how applications share context with large language models (LLMs). MCP provides a standardized way to connect AI models to different data sources and tools, enabling them to work together more effectively.\\nThe following MCP servers are configured automatically for Copilot coding agent:\\nGitHub: The GitHub MCP server gives Copilot access to GitHub data like issues and pull requests. To learn more, see Using the GitHub MCP Server.\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Model Context Protocol servers\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/ModelContextProtocol/servers\",\n      \"description\": \"The servers in this repository showcase the versatility and extensibility of MCP, demonstrating how it can be used to give Large Language Models (LLMs) secure, controlled access to tools and data sources. Typically, each MCP server is implemented with an MCP SDK:\\nC# MCP SDK\\nGo MCP SDK...\\n Paper - Realistic paper trading platform with market simulation, 22 broker emulations, and professional tools for risk-free trading practice. First trading platform with MCP integration.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Model Context Protocol\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/ModelContextprotocol\",\n      \"description\": \"A protocol for seamless integration between LLM applications and external data sources\\nThe Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open protocol that enables seamless integration between LLM applications and external data sources and tools....\\nWhether you're building an AI-powered IDE, enhancing a chat interface, or creating custom AI workflows, MCP provides a standardized way to connect LLMs with the context they need.\\nGetting Started\\n📚 Read the Documentation for guides and tutorials\\n🔍 Review the Specification for protocol details\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Code Index MCP\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/johnhuang316/code-index-mcp\",\n      \"description\": \"johnhuang316</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>.agent</td><td...\\nClients that support the <beginning of the code>.well-known<end of the code> convention (e.g., Claude Desktop, Codex CLI) can import this file directly instead of crafting configs manually.\\nPublish <beginning of the code>.well-known/mcp.llmfeed.json<end of the code> when you want to expose the richer LLM Feed metadata. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub Repository\",\n      \"url\": \"https://mcpdir.dev/servers/github-repository\",\n      \"description\": \"This Model Context Protocol (MCP) server allows AI models to access GitHub repository contents as context. It provides tools to fetch file contents, repository structure, and entire repositories for use as context in AI interactions.\\nFeatures\\nFetch entire repository contents as context\\nGet specific file contents from a repository\\nget-repo-context: Get all files from a GitHub repository to use as context\\nParameters:\\n<beginning of the code>owner<end of the code>: GitHub repository owner/organ...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"MCP (Model Context Protocol) for Go\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/viant/mcp\",\n      \"description\": \"MCP (Model Context Protocol) for Go\\nMCP is a Go implementation of the Model Context Protocol — a standardized way for applications to communicate with AI models. It allows developers to seamlessly bridge applications...\\nThis repository provides the Go MCP client/server runtime, bridge, and auth helpers. Protocol definitions and schemas live in mcp-protocol .\\nOfficial Model Context Protocol Specification\\nOverview\\nMCP (Model Context Protocol) is designed to provide a standardized communication layer between applications and AI models. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"What Is the Model Context Protocol (MCP)? Complete 2026 Guide\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.mcpserverspot.com/learn/fundamentals/what-is-model-context-protocol\",\n      \"description\": \"Created by Anthropic and released on November 25, 2024, MCP defines how AI applications communicate with the outside world through a shared protocol built on JSON-R...\\nAnd hundreds of other actions -- all through the same protocol\\nBefore MCP, each of these integrations required custom code specific to each AI vendor. After MCP, a single MCP server can serve any AI application that speaks the protocol.\\nThe Problem MCP Solves: N x M Fragmentation\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"1688 MCP server github model context protocol","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"About Model Context Protocol (MCP)","url":"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/using-github-copilot/using-extensions-to-integrate-external-tools-with-copilot-chat","description":"You can also use MCP to create new tools and services that work with Copilot Chat, allowing you to customize and enhance your experience.\nFor more information on MCP, see the official MCP documentation. For information on currently available MCP servers,...\nSupport for remote MCP servers is growing, with editors like Visual Studio Code, Visual Studio, JetBrains IDEs, Xcode, Eclipse, and Cursor providing this functionality with OAuth or PAT, and Windsurf supporting PAT only.\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Sobre o Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo (MCP)","url":"https://docs.github.com/pt/copilot/concepts/context/mcp","description":"O MCP (Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo) é um protocolo que permite estender os recursos do GitHub Copilot integrando...\nO MCP (Protocolo de Contexto de Modelo) é um padrão aberto que define como os aplicativos compartilham contexto com os LLMs (modelos de linguagem grande). O MCP fornece um modo padronizado de conectar modelos de IA a diferentes fontes de dados e ferramentas,","siteName":""},{"title":"modelcontextprotocol/docs/specification/draft/basic/index.mdx at main · modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/blob/main/docs/specification/draft/basic/index.mdx","description":"Server Features: Resources, prompts, and tools exposed by servers\nClient Features: Sampling and root directory lists provided by clients\nUtilities: Cross-cutting concerns like logging and argument completion\nAll implementations MUST support the base protocol and lifecycle management components. Other components MAY be implemented based on the specific needs of the application.\nThese protocol layers establish clear separation of concerns while enabling rich interactions between clients and servers. The modular design allows implementations to support exactly the features they need.\nMessages\nError...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Protocole MCP (Model Context Protocol) et assistant de codage GitHub Copilot","url":"https://docs.github.com/fr/copilot/concepts/agents/coding-agent/mcp-and-coding-agent","description":"The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open standard that defines how applications share context with large language models (LLMs). MCP provides a standardized way to connect AI models to different data sources and tools, enabling them to work together more effectively.\nThe following MCP servers are configured automatically for Copilot coding agent:\nGitHub: The GitHub MCP server gives Copilot access to GitHub data like issues and pull requests. To learn more, see Using the GitHub MCP Server.\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Model Context Protocol servers","url":"https://github.com/ModelContextProtocol/servers","description":"The servers in this repository showcase the versatility and extensibility of MCP, demonstrating how it can be used to give Large Language Models (LLMs) secure, controlled access to tools and data sources. Typically, each MCP server is implemented with an MCP SDK:\nC# MCP SDK\nGo MCP SDK...\n Paper - Realistic paper trading platform with market simulation, 22 broker emulations, and professional tools for risk-free trading practice. First trading platform with MCP integration.","siteName":""},{"title":"Model Context Protocol","url":"https://github.com/ModelContextprotocol","description":"A protocol for seamless integration between LLM applications and external data sources\nThe Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open protocol that enables seamless integration between LLM applications and external data sources and tools....\nWhether you're building an AI-powered IDE, enhancing a chat interface, or creating custom AI workflows, MCP provides a standardized way to connect LLMs with the context they need.\nGetting Started\n📚 Read the Documentation for guides and tutorials\n🔍 Review the Specification for protocol details\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Code Index MCP","url":"https://github.com/johnhuang316/code-index-mcp","description":"johnhuang316</td></tr>\n<tr><td>.agent</td><td...\nClients that support the <beginning of the code>.well-known<end of the code> convention (e.g., Claude Desktop, Codex CLI) can import this file directly instead of crafting configs manually.\nPublish <beginning of the code>.well-known/mcp.llmfeed.json<end of the code> when you want to expose the richer LLM Feed metadata. ","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub Repository","url":"https://mcpdir.dev/servers/github-repository","description":"This Model Context Protocol (MCP) server allows AI models to access GitHub repository contents as context. It provides tools to fetch file contents, repository structure, and entire repositories for use as context in AI interactions.\nFeatures\nFetch entire repository contents as context\nGet specific file contents from a repository\nget-repo-context: Get all files from a GitHub repository to use as context\nParameters:\n<beginning of the code>owner<end of the code>: GitHub repository owner/organ...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"MCP (Model Context Protocol) for Go","url":"https://github.com/viant/mcp","description":"MCP (Model Context Protocol) for Go\nMCP is a Go implementation of the Model Context Protocol — a standardized way for applications to communicate with AI models. It allows developers to seamlessly bridge applications...\nThis repository provides the Go MCP client/server runtime, bridge, and auth helpers. Protocol definitions and schemas live in mcp-protocol .\nOfficial Model Context Protocol Specification\nOverview\nMCP (Model Context Protocol) is designed to provide a standardized communication layer between applications and AI models. ","siteName":""},{"title":"What Is the Model Context Protocol (MCP)? Complete 2026 Guide","url":"https://www.mcpserverspot.com/learn/fundamentals/what-is-model-context-protocol","description":"Created by Anthropic and released on November 25, 2024, MCP defines how AI applications communicate with the outside world through a shared protocol built on JSON-R...\nAnd hundreds of other actions -- all through the same protocol\nBefore MCP, each of these integrations required custom code specific to each AI vendor. After MCP, a single MCP server can serve any AI application that speaks the protocol.\nThe Problem MCP Solves: N x M Fragmentation\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776212146714}}
{"type":"message","id":"d1ff068f","parentId":"c7933981","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:15:46.906Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_kme9zajubfwm_2","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"1688 CLI 命令行工具 github 开源\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub CLI 使用教程 - AtomGit | GitCode博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.gitcode.com/5d3ac2b2dbca90535bac24956f9365b4.html\",\n      \"description\": \"cli/cli: cli (GitHub CLI) 是GitHub官方提供的命令行...\\nGitHub CLI（命令行界面）是一个开源项目，旨在将 GitHub 的工作流程直接带到命令行中。它允许用户在不离开终端的情况下执行各种 GitHub 操作，如管理问题、拉取请求、发布等。GitHub CLI 提供了一种高效、直接的方式来与 GitHub 交互，特别适合开发者、运维人员和任何喜欢命令行工具的用户。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenCLI\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/jackwener/opencli\",\n      \"description\": \"Zero risk · Reuse Chrome login · AI-powered discovery\\n中文文档\\nA CLI tool that turns any website into a command-line interface — bilibili, zhihu, xiaohongshu, twitter, reddit, and many more — powered by browser session reuse and AI-native discovery.\\nTable of Contents\\nHighlights\\nPrerequisites\\nQuick Start\\nBuilt-in Commands\\nOutput Formats\\nAI Agent ready — <beginning of the code>explore<end of the code...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"神了!用命令行管理你的 GitHub 项目，不必再开网页!-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_40787712/article/details/109063922\",\n      \"description\": \"GitHub CLI的命令相当好记，全都以gh开头，之后跟上alias、api、pr、release、repo等，这些命令可以说是“顾名思义”。\\n比如gh repo就是对存储库进行操作：gh repo clone是克隆存储库，gh repo create是新建存储库，gh repo fork是合并存储库。\\n对于拉取请求也是类似，gh pr后加上create、checkout、diff、review即实现相应功能。\\n\\nGitHub CLI还有一项重要...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub 命令行工具是什么?GitHub CLI 安装与使用说明-电脑软件-PHP中文网\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.php.cn/faq/2169555.html\",\n      \"description\": \"github cli 是官方终端工具，支持跨平台管理仓库、拉取请求和议题；需先安装 git 并配置用户信息，再通过包管理器或手动下载安装，最后运行 gh auth login 完成认证...\\nGitHub 命令行工具（GitHub CLI）是一个官方提供的终端命令行程序，用于在不离开终端环境的情况下直接与 GitHub 交互。它支持管理仓库、创建和审查拉取请求、处理议题、运行操作等工作。\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub CLI到底是干什么的?一共包含哪些部分?使用场景是什么?底层原理是什么?-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/qq_36777143/article/details/146636696\",\n      \"description\": \"GitHub CLI（Command Line Interface）是 GitHub 提供的一个命令行工具，用于与 GitHub 进行交互。它允许开发者通过终端直接管理仓库、Pull Request、Issues 等，从而提升开发效率...\\n(2) 组成部分\\n<代码开始>gh<代码结束> 命令：CLI 的主入口。\\n子命令：按功能模块划分的命令集。\\n配置文件：存储用户配置和认证信息。\\n插件系统：支持扩展功能。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub Command 是什么?GitHub 命令行工具使用讲解-电脑软件-PHP中文网\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.php.cn/faq/2132357.html\",\n      \"description\": \"如果您希望在不离开终端的情况下高效操作 GitHub 仓库、议题、拉取请求等资源，则需要借助 GitHub 命令行工具。GitHub Command 指的是 GitHub CLI（gh），它是 GitHub 官方推出的开源命令行界面工具，专为与 GitHub 平台深度集成而设计。以下是对其核心用途与使用方式的详细说明：\\nGitHub CLI 是一个独立于 Git 命令行的工具，其可执行文件名为 gh...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"gh:提升GitHub操作效率的CLI工具-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00959/article/details/147109165\",\n      \"description\": \"<代码开始>gh<代码结束> 是一个开源的命令行工具，旨在帮助开发者提升在GitHub上的操作效率。它通过提供一系列的命令，允许用户在命令行界面（CLI ）中直接执行常见的GitHub操作，如管理仓库、处理Pull Requests、管理Issues、创建Gists等。使用 <代码开始>gh<代码结束>，开发者可以减少在网页界面中频繁切换的时间，提高工作流的效率。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Guide de démarrage rapide sur l’interface CLI de GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.github.com/fr/enterprise-cloud@latest/github-cli/github-cli/quickstart\",\n      \"description\": \"GitHub CLI is an open source tool for using GitHub from your computer's command line. When you're working from the command line, you can use the GitHub CLI to save time and avoid switching context.\\nInstall GitHub CLI on macOS, Windows, or Linux. For more information, see Installation in the GitHub CLI repository.\\nGitHub CLI automatically stores your Git credentials for you when you choose HTTPS as your preferred protocol for Git operations and answer \\\"yes\\\" to the prompt asking if you would like to...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub CLI如何促进协作与沟通?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.feishu.cn/v/wiki/UvApw9Zk6iUI86kqzK3cbWKbnxf/a5\",\n      \"description\": \"GitHub CLI 是一个开源的命令行工具，旨在让开发者能够直接从终端与 GitHub 进行交互。它提供了一系列的命令，涵盖了从项目创建、代码管理、问题跟踪到协作等各个方面的操作。通过使用 GitHub CLI，开发者可以摆脱繁琐的网页操作，更加专注于代码开发和项目管理。\\n- `gh pr create`：创建新的拉取请求（Pull Request）。您可以指定分支、标题、描述等...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub CLI:命令行GitHub指南-IT业界-PHP中文网\",\n      \"url\": \"https://global.php.cn/zh/faq/1796766038.html\",\n      \"description\": \"GitHub CLI 允许用户在不离开命令行界面的情况下，对 GitHub 仓库执行各种操作，无需切换到网页浏览器。\\nGitHub CLI 命令结构类似树状，包含两层：第一层包含六个命令：...\\n每个命令都有第二层，用户可以在其中指定要执行的操作。\\nGitHub CLI 允许用户直接从命令行克隆、fork、查看和创建仓库。它还包括用于创建和管理拉取请求、问题和 gist 的命令。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"1688 CLI 命令行工具 github 开源","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"GitHub CLI 使用教程 - AtomGit | GitCode博客","url":"https://blog.gitcode.com/5d3ac2b2dbca90535bac24956f9365b4.html","description":"cli/cli: cli (GitHub CLI) 是GitHub官方提供的命令行...\nGitHub CLI（命令行界面）是一个开源项目，旨在将 GitHub 的工作流程直接带到命令行中。它允许用户在不离开终端的情况下执行各种 GitHub 操作，如管理问题、拉取请求、发布等。GitHub CLI 提供了一种高效、直接的方式来与 GitHub 交互，特别适合开发者、运维人员和任何喜欢命令行工具的用户。\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenCLI","url":"https://github.com/jackwener/opencli","description":"Zero risk · Reuse Chrome login · AI-powered discovery\n中文文档\nA CLI tool that turns any website into a command-line interface — bilibili, zhihu, xiaohongshu, twitter, reddit, and many more — powered by browser session reuse and AI-native discovery.\nTable of Contents\nHighlights\nPrerequisites\nQuick Start\nBuilt-in Commands\nOutput Formats\nAI Agent ready — <beginning of the code>explore<end of the code...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"神了!用命令行管理你的 GitHub 项目，不必再开网页!-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_40787712/article/details/109063922","description":"GitHub CLI的命令相当好记，全都以gh开头，之后跟上alias、api、pr、release、repo等，这些命令可以说是“顾名思义”。\n比如gh repo就是对存储库进行操作：gh repo clone是克隆存储库，gh repo create是新建存储库，gh repo fork是合并存储库。\n对于拉取请求也是类似，gh pr后加上create、checkout、diff、review即实现相应功能。\n\nGitHub CLI还有一项重要...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub 命令行工具是什么?GitHub CLI 安装与使用说明-电脑软件-PHP中文网","url":"https://m.php.cn/faq/2169555.html","description":"github cli 是官方终端工具，支持跨平台管理仓库、拉取请求和议题；需先安装 git 并配置用户信息，再通过包管理器或手动下载安装，最后运行 gh auth login 完成认证...\nGitHub 命令行工具（GitHub CLI）是一个官方提供的终端命令行程序，用于在不离开终端环境的情况下直接与 GitHub 交互。它支持管理仓库、创建和审查拉取请求、处理议题、运行操作等工作。","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub CLI到底是干什么的?一共包含哪些部分?使用场景是什么?底层原理是什么?-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/qq_36777143/article/details/146636696","description":"GitHub CLI（Command Line Interface）是 GitHub 提供的一个命令行工具，用于与 GitHub 进行交互。它允许开发者通过终端直接管理仓库、Pull Request、Issues 等，从而提升开发效率...\n(2) 组成部分\n<代码开始>gh<代码结束> 命令：CLI 的主入口。\n子命令：按功能模块划分的命令集。\n配置文件：存储用户配置和认证信息。\n插件系统：支持扩展功能。\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub Command 是什么?GitHub 命令行工具使用讲解-电脑软件-PHP中文网","url":"https://m.php.cn/faq/2132357.html","description":"如果您希望在不离开终端的情况下高效操作 GitHub 仓库、议题、拉取请求等资源，则需要借助 GitHub 命令行工具。GitHub Command 指的是 GitHub CLI（gh），它是 GitHub 官方推出的开源命令行界面工具，专为与 GitHub 平台深度集成而设计。以下是对其核心用途与使用方式的详细说明：\nGitHub CLI 是一个独立于 Git 命令行的工具，其可执行文件名为 gh...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"gh:提升GitHub操作效率的CLI工具-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00959/article/details/147109165","description":"<代码开始>gh<代码结束> 是一个开源的命令行工具，旨在帮助开发者提升在GitHub上的操作效率。它通过提供一系列的命令，允许用户在命令行界面（CLI ）中直接执行常见的GitHub操作，如管理仓库、处理Pull Requests、管理Issues、创建Gists等。使用 <代码开始>gh<代码结束>，开发者可以减少在网页界面中频繁切换的时间，提高工作流的效率。\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Guide de démarrage rapide sur l’interface CLI de GitHub","url":"https://docs.github.com/fr/enterprise-cloud@latest/github-cli/github-cli/quickstart","description":"GitHub CLI is an open source tool for using GitHub from your computer's command line. When you're working from the command line, you can use the GitHub CLI to save time and avoid switching context.\nInstall GitHub CLI on macOS, Windows, or Linux. For more information, see Installation in the GitHub CLI repository.\nGitHub CLI automatically stores your Git credentials for you when you choose HTTPS as your preferred protocol for Git operations and answer \"yes\" to the prompt asking if you would like to...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub CLI如何促进协作与沟通?","url":"https://docs.feishu.cn/v/wiki/UvApw9Zk6iUI86kqzK3cbWKbnxf/a5","description":"GitHub CLI 是一个开源的命令行工具，旨在让开发者能够直接从终端与 GitHub 进行交互。它提供了一系列的命令，涵盖了从项目创建、代码管理、问题跟踪到协作等各个方面的操作。通过使用 GitHub CLI，开发者可以摆脱繁琐的网页操作，更加专注于代码开发和项目管理。\n- `gh pr create`：创建新的拉取请求（Pull Request）。您可以指定分支、标题、描述等...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub CLI:命令行GitHub指南-IT业界-PHP中文网","url":"https://global.php.cn/zh/faq/1796766038.html","description":"GitHub CLI 允许用户在不离开命令行界面的情况下，对 GitHub 仓库执行各种操作，无需切换到网页浏览器。\nGitHub CLI 命令结构类似树状，包含两层：第一层包含六个命令：...\n每个命令都有第二层，用户可以在其中指定要执行的操作。\nGitHub CLI 允许用户直接从命令行克隆、fork、查看和创建仓库。它还包括用于创建和管理拉取请求、问题和 gist 的命令。\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776212146858}}
{"type":"message","id":"b4d0e313","parentId":"d1ff068f","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:15:46.957Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_kme9zajubfwm_3","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"openclaw 1688 MCP skill 采购\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Alibaba Supplier Outreach\",\n      \"url\": \"https://getclawkit.com/skills/official-blockchainhb-alibaba-supplier-outreach\",\n      \"description\": \"Alibaba Supplier Outreach\\nSkill by blockchainhb\\nskill-install — Terminal\\n<beginning of the code>clawhub install openclaw/skills/skills/blockchainhb/alibaba-supplier-outreach<end of the code>\\nname: alibaba-supplier-outreach description: | Find Alibaba suppliers via LaunchFast, contact them with optimized outreach messages, check their replies, and manage ongoing negotiations. Built for Amazon FBA sellers.\\nUSE THIS SKILL FOR:\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"inquiry-1688 - OpenClaw AI Agent Skill | LLMBase\",\n      \"url\": \"https://llmbase.ai/openclaw/inquiry-1688/\",\n      \"description\": \"OpenClaw Skill\\n向1688供应商发起询盘对话，就商品的价格、起订量、定制、物流、资质、规格、样品等问题咨询商家， 自动提交询盘并在20分钟后获取供应商的回复结果，通过钉钉主动推送给用户。 适用于跨境采购、批发拿货、OEM定制等场景下需要与1688商家沟通的需求。向1688供应商发起询盘，20...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw Skill保姆级教程:阿里云/本地部署+100个Skill实战+百炼免费额度API配置+避坑指南-阿里云开发者社区\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.aliyun.com:443/article/1717045\",\n      \"description\": \"前往轻量应用服务器控制台，找到安装好OpenClaw的实例，进入「应用详情」放行18789端口、配置百炼API-Key、执行命令，生成访问OpenClaw的Token。\\n\\n-p 18789:18789 \\\\\\n浏览器访问 <代码开始>http://服务器公网IP:18789<代码结束> （阿里云）或 <代码开始>http://localhost:18...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw Skills 技能市场完全指南:ClawHub 必装技能、安全避坑与自定义开发(2026)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ofox.ai/zh/blog/openclaw-skills-clawhub-complete-guide-2026/\",\n      \"description\": \"<tr><th>维度</th><th>MCP（Model Context Protocol）</th><th>Skills</th></tr><tr><td>层级</td><td>底层通信协议</td><td>高层应用抽象</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>类比</td><td>相当于 HTTP 协议</td><td>相当于 Web 应用</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>分发方式</td><td>npm/pip 包或...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"电商选品避坑指南!Open Claw 1688 店铺搜索 API，精准锁定优质供应商(附 Python 源码 + 数据实测 + FAQ)-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/wbryze/article/details/160118266\",\n      \"description\": \"✅ 精准搜店：关键词一键检索，全网匹配工厂 / 供应商，不遗漏优质货源✅ 多维筛选：支持销量、回头客、实力等级、发货时效、起订量组合过滤✅ 数据完整：店铺核心信息一次性返回，无需二次收集、...\\n输入关键词，批量获取 1688 平台店铺数据，支持排序、筛选，精准定位源头工厂、实力供应商，是无货源、跨境、店群卖家的必备工具。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"电商效率神器!Open Claw对接1688接口，全自动监控选品教程(附完整源码)-阿里云开发者社区\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.aliyun.com/article/1722133\",\n      \"description\": \"✅ 接口稳定：长期维护，自动适配平台更新\\n✅ 数据全：一次拿到选品所有字段，不用二次拼接\\n✅ 上手简单：一行代码调用，新手也能5分钟跑通\\n✅ 性价比高：比爬虫、采集器、人工统计成本低10倍以上\\n✅ 支持监控：可直接做7×24小时价格/库存监控\\n✅ 多语言支持：Python/PHP/Java/JS均可调用\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw+MCP+SKILL实操:AI辅助变现3赛道，从验证到自动化_算力收藏家\",\n      \"url\": \"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7628161244091990566/\",\n      \"description\": \"变现关联\\nOpenClaw\\n本地优先AI智能体引擎\\n持久记忆、自主执行、跨软件操作、多IM交互\\nAI辅助执行核心载体，配合人工审核，提升任务效率\\nMCP\\n模型与工具标准化通信协议\\n统一API调用、安全权限管控、结果双向传输\\n打通AI与外部工具(如自媒体平台、数据库)，解决“通信碎片化”，降低人工操作成本\\nSKILL\\n模块化任务能力包\\n固定流程封装、...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"电商效率翻倍:用 Open Claw 对接 1688 接口，快速实现图片选品 + 货源监控-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/2503_93443381/article/details/160024012\",\n      \"description\": \"今天给大家分享一套零复杂开发、直接可用的方案：用 Open Claw 标准化接口，对接 1688 按图搜货能力，5 分钟实现图片找同款、批量选品、自动监控 ...\\n这里用到的是 Open Claw 提供的1688.item_search_img接口，也就是 1688 官方拍立淘能力的标准化封装，不用复杂权限、不用企业资质，拿到 key 就能用。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"1688-shopkeeper - OpenClaw AI Agent Skill | LLMBase\",\n      \"url\": \"https://llmbase.ai/openclaw/1688-shopkeeper-official/\",\n      \"description\": \"1688选品铺货 + 商机...\\n用于：(1) 在1688搜索商品/选品找货源 (2) 查询已绑定的下游店铺 (3) 将商品铺货到抖音/拼多多/小红书/淘宝等平台 (4) 配置1688 AK密钥 (5) 查看即时商机热榜 (6) 查看类目/行业趋势与价格分布 (7) 生成店铺经营日报并输出主营商品选品建议。\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw(小龙虾)新手保姆级攻略:计算巢+本地部署+Skills集成+阿里云Coding Plan 等免费大模型API配置+避坑指南-阿里云开发者社区\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.aliyun.com/article/1716657\",\n      \"description\": \"阿里云百炼Coding Plan 配置教程：创建API-Key，推荐访问订阅阿里云百炼Coding Plan，阿里云百炼Coding Plan每天两场抢购活动，从按tokens计费升级为按次收费，可以进一步节省费用！\\n\\n购买后，在控制台生成API Key。注：这里复制并保存好你的API Key，后面要用。\\n\\n回到...\\n\\n这里系统会列出我们第一步中创建的阿里云百炼 Coding Plan的API Key，直接选择就可以。\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"openclaw 1688 MCP skill 采购","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"Alibaba Supplier Outreach","url":"https://getclawkit.com/skills/official-blockchainhb-alibaba-supplier-outreach","description":"Alibaba Supplier Outreach\nSkill by blockchainhb\nskill-install — Terminal\n<beginning of the code>clawhub install openclaw/skills/skills/blockchainhb/alibaba-supplier-outreach<end of the code>\nname: alibaba-supplier-outreach description: | Find Alibaba suppliers via LaunchFast, contact them with optimized outreach messages, check their replies, and manage ongoing negotiations. Built for Amazon FBA sellers.\nUSE THIS SKILL FOR:\n","siteName":""},{"title":"inquiry-1688 - OpenClaw AI Agent Skill | LLMBase","url":"https://llmbase.ai/openclaw/inquiry-1688/","description":"OpenClaw Skill\n向1688供应商发起询盘对话，就商品的价格、起订量、定制、物流、资质、规格、样品等问题咨询商家， 自动提交询盘并在20分钟后获取供应商的回复结果，通过钉钉主动推送给用户。 适用于跨境采购、批发拿货、OEM定制等场景下需要与1688商家沟通的需求。向1688供应商发起询盘，20...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw Skill保姆级教程:阿里云/本地部署+100个Skill实战+百炼免费额度API配置+避坑指南-阿里云开发者社区","url":"https://developer.aliyun.com:443/article/1717045","description":"前往轻量应用服务器控制台，找到安装好OpenClaw的实例，进入「应用详情」放行18789端口、配置百炼API-Key、执行命令，生成访问OpenClaw的Token。\n\n-p 18789:18789 \\\n浏览器访问 <代码开始>http://服务器公网IP:18789<代码结束> （阿里云）或 <代码开始>