AK密钥 (5) 查看即时商机热榜 (6) 查看类目/行业趋势与价格分布 (7) 生成店铺经营日报并输出主营商品选品建议。","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw(小龙虾)新手保姆级攻略:计算巢+本地部署+Skills集成+阿里云Coding Plan 等免费大模型API配置+避坑指南-阿里云开发者社区","url":"https://developer.aliyun.com/article/1716657","description":"阿里云百炼Coding Plan 配置教程：创建API-Key，推荐访问订阅阿里云百炼Coding Plan，阿里云百炼Coding Plan每天两场抢购活动，从按tokens计费升级为按次收费，可以进一步节省费用！\n\n购买后，在控制台生成API Key。注：这里复制并保存好你的API Key，后面要用。\n\n回到...\n\n这里系统会列出我们第一步中创建的阿里云百炼 Coding Plan的API Key，直接选择就可以。\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776212146906}}
{"type":"message","id":"f3b747ba","parentId":"b4d0e313","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:15:55.752Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found some very relevant results! Let me analyze what I found:\n\n1. **OpenClaw Skill for 1688**: There are existing OpenClaw skills for 1688:\n   - `inquiry-1688` - 询盘工具，向1688供应商发起询盘对话\n   - `1688-shopkeeper` - 1688选品铺货工具\n   - `Alibaba Supplier Outreach` - Alibaba供应商开发\n\n2. There's also mention of OpenClaw having 1688 APIs integrated\n\nLet me search more specifically for OpenClaw 1688 MCP/skill."},{"type":"text","text":"有发现！让我进一步深挖！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nkid9ntllysc_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"clawhub 1688 skill openclaw 安装"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nkid9ntllysc_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"inquiry-1688 openclaw skill 1688询盘 github"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nkid9ntllysc_3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"1688 openclaw skill github npm 模型上下文协议"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776212146958,"responseId":"062e0bb347038d816c357fb86df5e4a6"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c82e33b5","parentId":"f3b747ba","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:15:57.564Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_nkid9ntllysc_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"clawhub 1688 skill openclaw 安装\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"ClawHub | Docs | OpenClaw\",\n      \"url\": \"https://openclaws.io/zh/docs/tools/clawhub/\",\n      \"description\": \"ClawHub 是 OpenClaw 的公共技能注册中心。安装 CLI（见下一节）。\\n安装一个技能：\\n<代码开始>clawhub install <skill-slug><代码结束>\\n开一个新的 OpenClaw 会话，让它加载新技能。\\n安装 CLI\\n选一个：\\n<代码开始>npm i -g clawhub<代码结束>\\n<代码开始>pnpm add -g clawhub<代码结束>\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Installing Skills\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.openclawdoc.com/docs/skills/installation/\",\n      \"description\": \"ClawHub is the official skill registry for OpenClaw. It is the fastest and most reliable way to add skills to your agent.\\nSearch for a Skill\\nBrowse available skills directly from the CLI:\\nopenclaw skill search \\\"weather\\\"\\nOnce you have found the skill you want, install it by name:\\nopenclaw skill install weather-now\\nThe CLI downloads the latest stable version, validates the manifest, and registers the skill with your agent.\\nInstall a...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw(“小龙虾”)保姆级教程:(阿里云/Win11/Mac/Linux)部署+百炼API配置+16个必装Skill 及避坑指南-阿里云开发者社区\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.aliyun.com:443/article/1715697\",\n      \"description\": \"# 安装clawhub（OpenClaw插件市场管理工具）\\nnpm install -g clawhub\\n# 配置clawhub国内镜像（解决插件下载超时）\\nclawhub config set registry https://clawhub-mirror.aliyuncs.com\\nnpm install -g openclaw@latest claw...\\n安装：优先安装核心必装插件（find-skills、summarize、openai-whisper等），再按需安装专业场景插件；\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How to Install OpenClaw Skills\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ohmyopenclaw.ai/install-guide/\",\n      \"description\": \"<beginning of the code>clawhub install fal-ai<end of the code>\\nList installed skills:\\n<beginning of the code>clawhub list<end of the code>\\nSkills are installed to <beginning of the code>~/.openclaw/skills/<end of the code>\\nMethod 2: Manual Installation\\nFor custom skills or skills not on ClawHub, install manually:\\nStep 1: Create skill directory\\n<...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw 使用简介OpenClaw 是一个功能强大的 AI Agent 平台，具有模块化的skills系统，强大 - 掘金\",\n      \"url\": \"https://juejin.cn/post/7615031075312893986\",\n      \"description\": \"安装 Skills 的三种方式\\n方式一：ClawHub 一键安装（推荐）\\nClawHub 是 OpenClaw 官方技能市场，已收录 9000+ 款技能。\\n# 搜索技能\\nclawhub search <keyword>\\n# 安装技能到当前工作区（默认路径：./skills）\\nclawhub install <skill-name>\\n# 安装到全局\\nclawhub install -g <skill-name>\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw Skills 安装全流程:目录区别、ClawHub 登录、限流、远程服务器回调失败一次讲透_clawhub login-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/m0_46808930/article/details/159208003\",\n      \"description\": \"第四步：登录 ClawHub\\nnpx clawhub login --token <你的ClawHub-API-Token>\\nnpx clawhub whoami\\n第五步：安装 skill\\n<beginning of the code>\\nnpx clawhub install nano-pdf\\n第六步：验证 skill 是否被 OpenClaw 识别\\n第七步：重启...\\n官方 quick start 里明确提到，安装后需要 start a new OpenClaw session，这样新 skill 才会被拾取。\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw龙虾安装教程_龙虾安装 csdn-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/sww_1026/article/details/158891606\",\n      \"description\": \"官方的skills市场clawhub\\nOpenClaw官方市场访问地址：https://clawhub.ai/skills?sort=downloads clawhub目前有16000多skill，我们尽量选择star数量高的\\n直接对话输入安装：https://clawhub.ai/gpyAngyoujun/multi-search-engine 把这个skill安装一下，安装一下multi-search搜索功能,安装成功会提示\\ngithub市场：awesome-claude-skills：https...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw从入门到精通保姆级教程!阿里云/本地部署+免费API配置+10个必装Skill实战记录-阿里云开发者社区\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.aliyun.com:443/article/1715229\",\n      \"description\": \"本文基于官方文档与实测经验，完整呈现2026年OpenClaw零基础阿里云及本地（Mac/Windows）部署流程、阿里云百炼API与免费大模型API（Ollama+Qwen2.5）双配置方案，精选1...\\ntype %USERPROFILE%\\\\.openclaw\\\\openclaw.json | findstr \\\"token\\\"\\n安装命令：<代码开始>npx clawhub@latest install weather<代码结束> ；\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw 推荐安装方法:三种方式完整指南 | 七牛云\",\n      \"url\": \"https://news.qiniu.com/archives/1773196662107\",\n      \"description\": \"OpenClaw 提供三种安装方式：一键脚本安装（推荐新手）、npm...\\n# 使用官方脚本的 git 模式\\ncurl -fsSL https://openclaw.ai/install.sh | bash -s -- --install-method git\\n# 或手动克隆\\ngit clone https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw.git\\ncd openclaw\\npnpm install && pnpm ui:build && pnpm build\\npnpm openclaw onboard --install-daemon\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw Skill 安装与管理指南:1700+技能等你探索 | 程序员晚枫 - Python自动化办公与AI编程\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.python4office.cn:8080/ai-skills/platform-guides/20260406-openclaw-skill-guide/\",\n      \"description\": \"环境要求\\nPython 3.8+\\nNode.js 16+\\nGit...\\n安装步骤\\n步骤 1：克隆仓库\\ngit clone https://github.com/claw-ai/openclaw.gitcd openclaw\\n步骤 2：安装依赖\\npip install -r requirements.txtnpm install\\n步骤 3：配置环境变量\\ncp .env.example .env# 编辑 .env 文件，填入你的 API Key\\n步骤 4：启动服务\\npython main.py\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"clawhub 1688 skill openclaw 安装","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"ClawHub | Docs | OpenClaw","url":"https://openclaws.io/zh/docs/tools/clawhub/","description":"ClawHub 是 OpenClaw 的公共技能注册中心。安装 CLI（见下一节）。\n安装一个技能：\n<代码开始>clawhub install <skill-slug><代码结束>\n开一个新的 OpenClaw 会话，让它加载新技能。\n安装 CLI\n选一个：\n<代码开始>npm i -g clawhub<代码结束>\n<代码开始>pnpm add -g clawhub<代码结束>\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Installing Skills","url":"https://www.openclawdoc.com/docs/skills/installation/","description":"ClawHub is the official skill registry for OpenClaw. It is the fastest and most reliable way to add skills to your agent.\nSearch for a Skill\nBrowse available skills directly from the CLI:\nopenclaw skill search \"weather\"\nOnce you have found the skill you want, install it by name:\nopenclaw skill install weather-now\nThe CLI downloads the latest stable version, validates the manifest, and registers the skill with your agent.\nInstall a...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw(“小龙虾”)保姆级教程:(阿里云/Win11/Mac/Linux)部署+百炼API配置+16个必装Skill 及避坑指南-阿里云开发者社区","url":"https://developer.aliyun.com:443/article/1715697","description":"# 安装clawhub（OpenClaw插件市场管理工具）\nnpm install -g clawhub\n# 配置clawhub国内镜像（解决插件下载超时）\nclawhub config set registry https://clawhub-mirror.aliyuncs.com\nnpm install -g openclaw@latest claw...\n安装：优先安装核心必装插件（find-skills、summarize、openai-whisper等），再按需安装专业场景插件；\n","siteName":""},{"title":"How to Install OpenClaw Skills","url":"https://ohmyopenclaw.ai/install-guide/","description":"<beginning of the code>clawhub install fal-ai<end of the code>\nList installed skills:\n<beginning of the code>clawhub list<end of the code>\nSkills are installed to <beginning of the code>~/.openclaw/skills/<end of the code>\nMethod 2: Manual Installation\nFor custom skills or skills not on ClawHub, install manually:\nStep 1: Create skill directory\n<...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw 使用简介OpenClaw 是一个功能强大的 AI Agent 平台，具有模块化的skills系统，强大 - 掘金","url":"https://juejin.cn/post/7615031075312893986","description":"安装 Skills 的三种方式\n方式一：ClawHub 一键安装（推荐）\nClawHub 是 OpenClaw 官方技能市场，已收录 9000+ 款技能。\n# 搜索技能\nclawhub search <keyword>\n# 安装技能到当前工作区（默认路径：./skills）\nclawhub install <skill-name>\n# 安装到全局\nclawhub install -g <skill-name>\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw Skills 安装全流程:目录区别、ClawHub 登录、限流、远程服务器回调失败一次讲透_clawhub login-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/m0_46808930/article/details/159208003","description":"第四步：登录 ClawHub\nnpx clawhub login --token <你的ClawHub-API-Token>\nnpx clawhub whoami\n第五步：安装 skill\n<beginning of the code>\nnpx clawhub install nano-pdf\n第六步：验证 skill 是否被 OpenClaw 识别\n第七步：重启...\n官方 quick start 里明确提到，安装后需要 start a new OpenClaw session，这样新 skill 才会被拾取。","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw龙虾安装教程_龙虾安装 csdn-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/sww_1026/article/details/158891606","description":"官方的skills市场clawhub\nOpenClaw官方市场访问地址：https://clawhub.ai/skills?sort=downloads clawhub目前有16000多skill，我们尽量选择star数量高的\n直接对话输入安装：https://clawhub.ai/gpyAngyoujun/multi-search-engine 把这个skill安装一下，安装一下multi-search搜索功能,安装成功会提示\ngithub市场：awesome-claude-skills：https...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw从入门到精通保姆级教程!阿里云/本地部署+免费API配置+10个必装Skill实战记录-阿里云开发者社区","url":"https://developer.aliyun.com:443/article/1715229","description":"本文基于官方文档与实测经验，完整呈现2026年OpenClaw零基础阿里云及本地（Mac/Windows）部署流程、阿里云百炼API与免费大模型API（Ollama+Qwen2.5）双配置方案，精选1...\ntype %USERPROFILE%\\.openclaw\\openclaw.json | findstr \"token\"\n安装命令：<代码开始>npx clawhub@latest install weather<代码结束> ；\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw 推荐安装方法:三种方式完整指南 | 七牛云","url":"https://news.qiniu.com/archives/1773196662107","description":"OpenClaw 提供三种安装方式：一键脚本安装（推荐新手）、npm...\n# 使用官方脚本的 git 模式\ncurl -fsSL https://openclaw.ai/install.sh | bash -s -- --install-method git\n# 或手动克隆\ngit clone https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw.git\ncd openclaw\npnpm install && pnpm ui:build && pnpm build\npnpm openclaw onboard --install-daemon\n","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenClaw Skill 安装与管理指南:1700+技能等你探索 | 程序员晚枫 - Python自动化办公与AI编程","url":"http://www.python4office.cn:8080/ai-skills/platform-guides/20260406-openclaw-skill-guide/","description":"环境要求\nPython 3.8+\nNode.js 16+\nGit...\n安装步骤\n步骤 1：克隆仓库\ngit clone https://github.com/claw-ai/openclaw.gitcd openclaw\n步骤 2：安装依赖\npip install -r requirements.txtnpm install\n步骤 3：配置环境变量\ncp .env.example .env# 编辑 .env 文件，填入你的 API Key\n步骤 4：启动服务\npython main.py\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776212157506}}
