{"type":"message","id":"439c6099","parentId":"02859510","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:23:19.007Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I have results for all three searches. Now let me analyze:\n\n1. **clawhub install failed** - the clawhub CLI isn't available in the current environment. That's fine - I can still use the skills that are already available or note that installation needs to be done in the OpenClaw environment with the CLI.\n\n2. **爱迪尔 ADEL 蓝牙门锁**:\n- 1688批发价：锁体约¥172-252\n- 安逸酒店集团：爱迪尔电子门锁市场价¥880，自营价¥545.9\n- 淘宝：约¥252（散件）\n\n3. **杨格 YG 蓝牙门锁**:\n- 1688批发价：¥118.75-216\n\n\n- 阿里巴巴国际站：€18.68-22.78（约¥147-179起订量≥10）\n- 酒店客户超过10万家\n\n4. **智能门锁成本拆解**:\n- 直接材料成本占45%-55%\n- 指纹识别模组约¥80-150\n- 主控芯片、电机驱动等核心组件\n\n智能门锁的原材料成本占总成本的28%-32%，加上生物识别模块占比25%-30%，蓝牙/WiFi模块约¥52和PCB制板约¥21。这说明爱迪尔和杨格的零售价在¥545-880之间，1688批发价约¥118-252，而出厂成本大约只有售价的30%-40%左右。现在需要建立多维表格来追踪项目进度和API密钥管理，同时创建2.0成本拆解系统的话题，并整理蓝牙门锁的市场调研数据。"},{"type":"text","text":"安装命令在当前环境不可用（需要OpenClaw CLI环境），但我已经拿到了所有关键数据！现在立刻建两个多维表格 + 立项2.0系统。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bkg4nq2c34yo_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app","arguments":{"action":"create","name":"🦞 德胧AI共享池-工具Key管理表"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776212586882,"responseId":"062e0d6a46d856bea6cc4b594a47ef96"}}
