{"type":"message","id":"d6ea8b28","parentId":"f9214350","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:25:41.016Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好，MEMORY.md已更新。现在让我汇报完整的成果给晁留柱。"},{"type":"text","text":"全部搞定！汇报如下 🦞\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 今天完成\n\n### 1. Skill引入（已找到，需要CLI安装）\n已在ClawHub找到4个官方Skill：\n- `1688-distributor` — 货源+AI筛选+批量分销铺货（2921次下载）\n- `cn-ecommerce-search` — **8平台比价**（1688/淘宝/京东/拼多多/抖音/天猫/咸鱼/小红书）\n- `inquiry-1688` — 1688询盘，20分钟自动拿结果\n- `1688-product-search` — 1688商品搜索9大接口\n\n> 当前环境`clawhub`命令不可用（需要SSH到部署服务器执行）\n\n### 2. 爱迪尔/杨格蓝牙门锁价格调研\n\n| 品牌 | 1688批发价 | 零售价 | 说明 |\n|------|-----------|--------|------|\n| 爱迪尔 ADEL | **¥172-556/把** | ¥880/把 | 酒店刷卡感应锁，12把起订 |\n| 杨格 YGS | **¥118-216/把** | ¥500-800/把 | 蓝牙/WiFi智能锁，10把起订 |\n\n**爱迪尔 vs 杨格**：杨格更便宜，爱迪尔品牌知名度更高\n\n### 3. 成本拆解参考（智能门锁BOM）\n\n| 成本项 | 占比 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| **直接材料** | 45-55% | 生物识别模块最贵（指纹头¥80-150） |\n| **人工成本** | 15-20% | 组装、检测 |\n| **制造费用** | 10-15% | 水电、租金、设备折旧 |\n| **品牌溢价** | 10-20% | 可剥离的\"冤枉钱\" |\n| **渠道利润** | 10-15% | 经销商利润 |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 两个多维表格已建立\n\n### 📊 项目进度管理表\n**URL**：`https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/TeIZbungWasADfsKcnjcogmMnCd`\n\n已录入2个项目：\n- **1.0**：1688价格检索工具（进行中→调研完成）\n- **2.0**：成本逆向拆解引擎（立项→计划4月底完成）\n\n### 🔑 工具Key管理表\n**URL**：`https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/VzL5bsdmDaZ4G9sc5SqcVRifn6d`\n\n已录入：\n- 1688开放平台Key（待申请）\n- cn-ecommerce-search（待安装配置）\n- inquiry-1688（待安装AlphaShop Key）\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 下一步需要你授权的操作\n\n**1. 申请1688开放平台Key**（必须）\n→ 地址：https://open.1688.com → 注册→创建自用型应用\n→ 拿到 key + secret 后我来配置\n\n**2. SSH到服务器安装Skill**（当前环境限制）\n```bash\nclawhub install 1688-distributor\nclawhub install cn-ecommerce-search\nclawhub install inquiry-1688\n```\n\n**3. 安装完成后测试**：输入\"酒店蓝牙门锁\"→全网比价→采购底线建议\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 2.0成本拆解系统（立项）\n\n**核心思路**：输入商品名称/图片 → AI逆向拆解为：\n- 原材料BOM（每项多少钱）\n- 人工成本（多少工时×单价）\n- 制造费用（水电+租金+折旧）\n- 品牌溢价（多少水分）\n- **输出：采购底线建议价**\n\n**技术路径**：AI BOM分析 + 行业成本系数库（已搜集） + RAG知识库\n\n这个2.0方向，**现在其实可以用AI直接做**——我手里已经有智能门锁的成本结构数据，你要不要现在就用AI给你拆解一下爱迪尔和杨格的成本底线？\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776212721783,"responseId":"062e0df1ecc7e110d6d061dc9813a498"}}
{"type":"message","id":"849caa05","parentId":"d6ea8b28","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:26:12.559Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-15 00:26:10 UTC] Feishu[default] group oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75 | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52d9fcd78cacc44ef022c2a2e22, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d9fcd78cacc44ef022c2a2e22\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-15 00:26 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_28df2a5e21d9139b72d9aaa9552c0b75\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n对了,除了clawhub上面,也还在github上去找一下开源的类似工具!  包括英文工具,咱们整合的是他们的能力!(针对这个采购询价工具)"}],"timestamp":1776212772508}}
{"type":"message","id":"b56b902c","parentId":"849caa05","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:26:17.274Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"小柱让我在GitHub上也搜索一下开源的采购询价工具，包括英文的。让我立刻搜索。"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 立刻搜！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fyhadbjkk9y1_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"github procurement sourcing tool open source RFQ quote request"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fyhadbjkk9y1_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"github alibaba 1688 scraper API open source procurement"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fyhadbjkk9y1_3","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"github supplier price comparison tool B2B sourcing"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776212772560,"responseId":"062e0e24040d9b706f55b34a029c839a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"523f4e12","parentId":"b56b902c","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:26:19.207Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_fyhadbjkk9y1_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"github procurement sourcing tool open source RFQ quote request\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"DataFlow Procurement Software\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/sorguido/dataflow-procurement-software\",\n      \"description\": \"📊 DataFlow is the essential desktop application designed to put an end to the dispersion of information typical of purchasing departments.\\n👨‍💼 Developed by a buyer for buyers, DataFlow offers a comprehensive platform to manage every stage of Requests for Quotation (RFQs), analyse supplier quotes, and measure procurement performance through dedicated KPI tracking.\\n✨ What's new in version 2.1.0: Value Stream Mapping (VSM) module for tracking Savings, Cost Avoidances...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Procuman - Open Source e-Procurement Software\",\n      \"url\": \"https://procuman.com/\",\n      \"description\": \"E-PROCUREMENT\\nFully customizable software with no-code developer tools to support your specific procure-to-pay process.\\nE-SOURCING\\nFully integrated Supplier Relationship Management Solution with AI Powered e-Tendering and Supplier Onboarding.\\nE-PROCUREMENT SOFTWARE\\nFully customizable software with no-code developer tools to support your specific procure-to-pay process.\\nSave Time\\nIncrease the productivity of your procurement team by automating workflows and manage all procurement information in one place\\n2. Enhance Collaboration\\nE...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Alibaba RFQ Scraper\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Aadesh1106/alibaba-rfq-scraper\",\n      \"description\": \"Alibaba RFQ Scraper\\nA Python web scraper that extracts Request for Quotation (RFQ) data from Alibaba's sourcing platform, specifically targeting UAE-based buyers.\\nFeatures\\nAutomated Web Scraping: Uses Selenium WebDriver to scrape RFQ data from Alibaba\\nUAE-Focused: Specifically targets RFQ listings from United Arab Emirates buyers\\nComprehensive Data Extraction: Captures detailed information including:\\nRFQ ID and Title\\nBuyer Name and Profile Image...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - Rakesh-honawad/ProcureFlow-AI · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Rakesh-honawad/ProcureFlow-AI\",\n      \"description\": \"Click \\\"Generate RFP\\\" - The AI will automatically parse your message and structure it into:\\nTitle - Generated from your requirements\\nDescription - Professional summary of needs\\nBudget - Extracted budget amount\\nDeadline - Identified submission deadline\\nLine Items - Structured list with:\\nItem descriptions\\nQuantities\\nSpecifications/requirements\\nVendor Requirements - Extracted quality/delivery criteria\\nReview and Edit - The AI-generated RFP will be displayed for your review. You can:\\nEdit...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Purchase Requisition Auto RFQ\",\n      \"url\": \"https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/14.0/purchase_requisition_auto_rfq\",\n      \"description\": \"This module adds a button on the purchase requisition form to create RFQs using the suppliers configured in the products listed in the requisition. The RFQ creation automatically detects if have duplicate suppliers in the requisition products.\\nTable of contents\\nUsage\\nBug Tracker\\nCredits\\nAuthors\\nContributors\\nMaintainers\\nUsage\\nIf the purchase manager is blank, the RFQs are created with the user as purchase representative\\nIf the purchase manager is established, the RFQs are created with...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Development of Open Procurement toolkit\",\n      \"url\": \"https://openprocurement.org/en/\",\n      \"description\": \"OpenProcurement is an open source e-procurement toolkit.\\nOpenProcurement's goal is to provide the tools to design and build a procurement process that is transparent and competative. The toolkit builds accessible processes that leverage auctions to drive savings and are backed by strong data collection and reporting. It is designed to be automated and scalable. Accessibility, transparency of tendering process, electronic documents, detailed reporting - these are only a few benefits of using this e-Procurement software.\\nhttp...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Procure, receive, pay, and manage suppliers efficiently\",\n      \"url\": \"https://frappe.io/erpnext/open-source-procurement\",\n      \"description\": \"Request for quotation\\nSimplify the quotation process by enabling Suppliers to access your Request for Quotation (RFQ) via the Supplier Portal—reducing back-and-forth communication. With all necessary details at your fingertips, issuing Purchase Orders becomes effortless. The buying workflow ensures you make...\\n\\nSupplier quotation\\nEffortlessly compile all supplier quotations received in response to your RFQ for easy comparison. Use the Supplier Quotation Report to perform a detailed line-by-line analysis of item pricing across multiple suppliers. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Open Source Purchase Order Management\",\n      \"url\": \"https://aureuserp.com/purchase-order-management/\",\n      \"description\": \"Smart Purchase Order Management in Aureus ERP\\nAutomate procurement, track purchase orders, and manage vendors efficiently—all in one place.\\nRFQs and Quotation Management\\nCreate and send RFQs to multiple vendors.\\nCompare quotations to choose the best offer.\\nSelect vendors based on pricing and terms.\\nPurchase Orders\\nAuto generate orders based on stock levels.\\nSet up frequent purchases with vendors.\\nUse smart filters to avoid shortages.\\nKeep vendor price lists up to date.\\n...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Purchase Request to RFQ\",\n      \"url\": \"https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/10.0/purchase_request_to_rfq\",\n      \"description\": \"Go to the Purchase Request Lines from the menu entry 'Purchase Requests', and also from the 'Purchase' menu.\\nSelect the lines that you wish to initiate the RFQ for, then go to 'More' and press 'Create RFQ'.\\nYou can choose to select an existing RFQ or create a new one. In the later, you have to choose a supplier.\\nIn case that you chose to select an existing RFQ, the application will search for existing lines matching the request...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Procure, receive, pay, and manage suppliers efficiently\",\n      \"url\": \"https://erpnext.com/open-source-sales-purchase\",\n      \"description\": \"Request for quotation\\nSimplify the quotation process by enabling Suppliers to access your Request for Quotation (RFQ) via the Supplier Portal—reducing back-and-forth communication. With all necessary details at your fingertips, issuing Purchase Orders becomes effortless. The buying workflow ensures you make informed purchasing decisions every time.\\nSupplier quotation\\nEffortlessly compile all supplier quotations received in response to your RFQ for easy comparison. Use the Supplier Quotation Report to perform a detailed line-by-line analysis of item...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"github procurement sourcing tool open source RFQ quote request","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"DataFlow Procurement Software","url":"https://github.com/sorguido/dataflow-procurement-software","description":"📊 DataFlow is the essential desktop application designed to put an end to the dispersion of information typical of purchasing departments.\n👨‍💼 Developed by a buyer for buyers, DataFlow offers a comprehensive platform to manage every stage of Requests for Quotation (RFQs), analyse supplier quotes, and measure procurement performance through dedicated KPI tracking.\n✨ What's new in version 2.1.0: Value Stream Mapping (VSM) module for tracking Savings, Cost Avoidances...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Procuman - Open Source e-Procurement Software","url":"https://procuman.com/","description":"E-PROCUREMENT\nFully customizable software with no-code developer tools to support your specific procure-to-pay process.\nE-SOURCING\nFully integrated Supplier Relationship Management Solution with AI Powered e-Tendering and Supplier Onboarding.\nE-PROCUREMENT SOFTWARE\nFully customizable software with no-code developer tools to support your specific procure-to-pay process.\nSave Time\nIncrease the productivity of your procurement team by automating workflows and manage all procurement information in one place\n2. Enhance Collaboration\nE...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Alibaba RFQ Scraper","url":"https://github.com/Aadesh1106/alibaba-rfq-scraper","description":"Alibaba RFQ Scraper\nA Python web scraper that extracts Request for Quotation (RFQ) data from Alibaba's sourcing platform, specifically targeting UAE-based buyers.\nFeatures\nAutomated Web Scraping: Uses Selenium WebDriver to scrape RFQ data from Alibaba\nUAE-Focused: Specifically targets RFQ listings from United Arab Emirates buyers\nComprehensive Data Extraction: Captures detailed information including:\nRFQ ID and Title\nBuyer Name and Profile Image...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - Rakesh-honawad/ProcureFlow-AI · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/Rakesh-honawad/ProcureFlow-AI","description":"Click \"Generate RFP\" - The AI will automatically parse your message and structure it into:\nTitle - Generated from your requirements\nDescription - Professional summary of needs\nBudget - Extracted budget amount\nDeadline - Identified submission deadline\nLine Items - Structured list with:\nItem descriptions\nQuantities\nSpecifications/requirements\nVendor Requirements - Extracted quality/delivery criteria\nReview and Edit - The AI-generated RFP will be displayed for your review. You can:\nEdit...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Purchase Requisition Auto RFQ","url":"https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/14.0/purchase_requisition_auto_rfq","description":"This module adds a button on the purchase requisition form to create RFQs using the suppliers configured in the products listed in the requisition. The RFQ creation automatically detects if have duplicate suppliers in the requisition products.\nTable of contents\nUsage\nBug Tracker\nCredits\nAuthors\nContributors\nMaintainers\nUsage\nIf the purchase manager is blank, the RFQs are created with the user as purchase representative\nIf the purchase manager is established, the RFQs are created with...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Development of Open Procurement toolkit","url":"https://openprocurement.org/en/","description":"OpenProcurement is an open source e-procurement toolkit.\nOpenProcurement's goal is to provide the tools to design and build a procurement process that is transparent and competative. The toolkit builds accessible processes that leverage auctions to drive savings and are backed by strong data collection and reporting. It is designed to be automated and scalable. Accessibility, transparency of tendering process, electronic documents, detailed reporting - these are only a few benefits of using this e-Procurement software.\nhttp...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Procure, receive, pay, and manage suppliers efficiently","url":"https://frappe.io/erpnext/open-source-procurement","description":"Request for quotation\nSimplify the quotation process by enabling Suppliers to access your Request for Quotation (RFQ) via the Supplier Portal—reducing back-and-forth communication. With all necessary details at your fingertips, issuing Purchase Orders becomes effortless. The buying workflow ensures you make...\n\nSupplier quotation\nEffortlessly compile all supplier quotations received in response to your RFQ for easy comparison. Use the Supplier Quotation Report to perform a detailed line-by-line analysis of item pricing across multiple suppliers. ","siteName":""},{"title":"Open Source Purchase Order Management","url":"https://aureuserp.com/purchase-order-management/","description":"Smart Purchase Order Management in Aureus ERP\nAutomate procurement, track purchase orders, and manage vendors efficiently—all in one place.\nRFQs and Quotation Management\nCreate and send RFQs to multiple vendors.\nCompare quotations to choose the best offer.\nSelect vendors based on pricing and terms.\nPurchase Orders\nAuto generate orders based on stock levels.\nSet up frequent purchases with vendors.\nUse smart filters to avoid shortages.\nKeep vendor price lists up to date.\n...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Purchase Request to RFQ","url":"https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/10.0/purchase_request_to_rfq","description":"Go to the Purchase Request Lines from the menu entry 'Purchase Requests', and also from the 'Purchase' menu.\nSelect the lines that you wish to initiate the RFQ for, then go to 'More' and press 'Create RFQ'.\nYou can choose to select an existing RFQ or create a new one. In the later, you have to choose a supplier.\nIn case that you chose to select an existing RFQ, the application will search for existing lines matching the request...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Procure, receive, pay, and manage suppliers efficiently","url":"https://erpnext.com/open-source-sales-purchase","description":"Request for quotation\nSimplify the quotation process by enabling Suppliers to access your Request for Quotation (RFQ) via the Supplier Portal—reducing back-and-forth communication. With all necessary details at your fingertips, issuing Purchase Orders becomes effortless. The buying workflow ensures you make informed purchasing decisions every time.\nSupplier quotation\nEffortlessly compile all supplier quotations received in response to your RFQ for easy comparison. Use the Supplier Quotation Report to perform a detailed line-by-line analysis of item...\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776212779164}}
