{"type":"message","id":"30534943","parentId":"390c7b96","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:26:19.298Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_fyhadbjkk9y1_3","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"github supplier price comparison tool B2B sourcing\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"product-sourcing\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/topics/product-sourcing\",\n      \"description\": \"#\\nproduct-sourcing\\nHere are 2 public repositories matching this topic...\\nBahm9919 / alibaba-products-scraper\\nScrape Alibaba product listings with prices, MOQ, supplier verification, specifications, and images. Essential for dropshipping, product sourcing, and price comparison.\\npython selenium data-extraction e-commerce price-comparison wholesale alibaba-scraper product-sourcing dropshipping-tool b2b-scraper\\nUpdated Feb 5,...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"DataFlow Procurement Software\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/sorguido/dataflow-procurement-software\",\n      \"description\": \"📌 Single Point of Reference: Each RFQ is a complete record that includes the negotiation history, requested items, technical references (drawings, codes) and deadlines.\\n⚖️ Objective Comparison: You will no longer have to manually extract data from quotation PDFs. Enter prices item by item to obtain an immediate and transparent comparison between offers from different suppliers.\\n📁 Integrated Archive: Quotation documents, internal communications, drawings and technical specifications are no longer attachments 'lost' in an inbox...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How to Compare Wholesale Prices Across Made-in-China, DHgate, and Yiwugo Using Data\",\n      \"url\": \"https://30tools.com/blogs/wfgsss/how-to-compare-wholesale-prices-across-made-in-china-dhgate-and-yiwugo-using-data-3n60\",\n      \"description\": \"com: Industrial/B2B products, verified manufacturers\\nA product that's cheapest on DHgate might have a lower MOQ on Yiwugo, or a more reliable supplier on Made-in-China.com. Without data from all three, you're making decisions with incomplete information.\\nStep 1: Set Up the Three Scrapers\\n- You need buyer protection and escrow\\n- Order quantities are small (1-100 units)\\n\\n**Choose Made-in-China.com when:**...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"智能决策数据源:利用 1688 商品详情 API 构建实时比价与供应链分析系统_1688 api商品比价工具-CSDN博客\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blog.csdn.net/2301_78671173/article/details/156307972\",\n      \"description\": \"1688 作为国内领先的批发电商平台，其商品详情 API 能够提供丰富的供应商信息、价格数据、库存状态等核心维度，基于该 API 构建实时比价与...\\n多商品实时价格对比（支持同款不同供应商价格横向对比）\\n供应商维度分析（销量、价格稳定性、供货能力）\\n价格趋势监控（设定价格阈值，异常波动预警）\\n供应链风险评估（基于库存、发货地、成交数据评估供应稳定性）\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How to Build a Wholesale Product Price Comparison Tool with Yiwugo Data\",\n      \"url\": \"https://dev.to/wfgsss/how-to-build-a-wholesale-product-price-comparison-tool-with-yiwugo-data-1c3\",\n      \"description\": \"In this tutorial, we'll build a practical price comparison tool using real product data from Yiwugo.com — China's largest small commodities marketplace.\\nBy the end, you'll have a working Python script that scrapes product data, normalizes prices, and generates comparison reports you can actually use for sourcing decisions.\\nReport Generation — Output a ranked comparison as CSV and terminal table\\nStep 1: Collect Product Data\\nWe'll use the Yiwugo Scraper on Apify to gather...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"price-comparator\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/ayoubbahssou/price-comparator\",\n      \"description\": \"price-comparator\\nPublic\\na web app that allows its users to search the price of a cerrtain product offered by multiple suppliers\\nCode\\nreadme.md\\npricomp\\na price comparator that allows its users to search the price of products offered by multiple suppliers it collects data from 3 different sources:\\nweb scraping\\nit scaps data from morrocan web sites:microchoix.ma,and jumia.ma ##amazon API to get products from amazon.com ##local...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Best-Price-Comparison-Tool\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/pricecomparison/Best-Price-Comparison-Tool\",\n      \"description\": \"pricecomparison</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>README.md</td><td>README.md</td><td>Initial commit</td><td></...\\nThe best price comparison engine that sits neatly in the corner of your browser, scouring the web for the best possible deal based on which product you are looking at. As you browse through Amazon and navigate to any product page, the widget will automatically search through other sellers of the same product and pull up a menu of price results.\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"BargainBuddy – Base v1.0.1 Smart Price Comparison and Scraping Engine\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/prantiksanki/Bargaining-Buddy\",\n      \"description\": \"It leverages real-time web scraping to fetch pricing from various online retailers and provides structured comparison data, including pricing trends and deal analytics.\\nThis project is part of our Software Engineering capstone at UPES.\\nTable of Contents\\nFeatures\\nTech Stack\\nArchitecture\\nAPI Endpoints\\nSetup and Installation\\nProject Structure\\nContributors\\nFuture Plans\\nFeatures\\nFull-text search for consumer products\\nDynamic product categorization using keyword inference\\nStealth web scraping using Puppeteer with anti-bot...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Price-Verify\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/danish7x7/Price-Verify\",\n      \"description\": \"danish7x7/Price-Verify\\nmain\\nCode\\n<table>\\n<tr><td>danish7x7</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>LICENSE</td><td>LICENSE</td><td>Initial commit</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>README.md</td><td>README.md</td><td>Initial commit</td><td></td></tr>\\n</table>\\nREADME\\nApache-...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How to Build a China Wholesale Price Tracker with DHgate and Yiwugo Data\",\n      \"url\": \"https://dev.to/wfgsss/how-to-build-a-china-wholesale-price-tracker-with-dhgate-and-yiwugo-data-1dea\",\n      \"description\": \"DHgate is cross-border focused — English interface, buyer protection, but often higher prices due to platform fees\\nThe same product category can have a 20-40% price gap between the two. Tracking both gives you:\\nArbitrage opportunities — buy where it's cheapest right now\\nNegotiation leverage — show a DHgate supplier that Yiwugo has it cheaper\\nTrend detection — if prices rise on both platforms simultaneously, demand is spiking\\nTiming optimization —...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"github supplier price comparison tool B2B sourcing","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"product-sourcing","url":"https://github.com/topics/product-sourcing","description":"#\nproduct-sourcing\nHere are 2 public repositories matching this topic...\nBahm9919 / alibaba-products-scraper\nScrape Alibaba product listings with prices, MOQ, supplier verification, specifications, and images. Essential for dropshipping, product sourcing, and price comparison.\npython selenium data-extraction e-commerce price-comparison wholesale alibaba-scraper product-sourcing dropshipping-tool b2b-scraper\nUpdated Feb 5,...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"DataFlow Procurement Software","url":"https://github.com/sorguido/dataflow-procurement-software","description":"📌 Single Point of Reference: Each RFQ is a complete record that includes the negotiation history, requested items, technical references (drawings, codes) and deadlines.\n⚖️ Objective Comparison: You will no longer have to manually extract data from quotation PDFs. Enter prices item by item to obtain an immediate and transparent comparison between offers from different suppliers.\n📁 Integrated Archive: Quotation documents, internal communications, drawings and technical specifications are no longer attachments 'lost' in an inbox...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"How to Compare Wholesale Prices Across Made-in-China, DHgate, and Yiwugo Using Data","url":"https://30tools.com/blogs/wfgsss/how-to-compare-wholesale-prices-across-made-in-china-dhgate-and-yiwugo-using-data-3n60","description":"com: Industrial/B2B products, verified manufacturers\nA product that's cheapest on DHgate might have a lower MOQ on Yiwugo, or a more reliable supplier on Made-in-China.com. Without data from all three, you're making decisions with incomplete information.\nStep 1: Set Up the Three Scrapers\n- You need buyer protection and escrow\n- Order quantities are small (1-100 units)\n\n**Choose Made-in-China.com when:**...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"智能决策数据源:利用 1688 商品详情 API 构建实时比价与供应链分析系统_1688 api商品比价工具-CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/2301_78671173/article/details/156307972","description":"1688 作为国内领先的批发电商平台，其商品详情 API 能够提供丰富的供应商信息、价格数据、库存状态等核心维度，基于该 API 构建实时比价与...\n多商品实时价格对比（支持同款不同供应商价格横向对比）\n供应商维度分析（销量、价格稳定性、供货能力）\n价格趋势监控（设定价格阈值，异常波动预警）\n供应链风险评估（基于库存、发货地、成交数据评估供应稳定性）\n","siteName":""},{"title":"How to Build a Wholesale Product Price Comparison Tool with Yiwugo Data","url":"https://dev.to/wfgsss/how-to-build-a-wholesale-product-price-comparison-tool-with-yiwugo-data-1c3","description":"In this tutorial, we'll build a practical price comparison tool using real product data from Yiwugo.com — China's largest small commodities marketplace.\nBy the end, you'll have a working Python script that scrapes product data, normalizes prices, and generates comparison reports you can actually use for sourcing decisions.\nReport Generation — Output a ranked comparison as CSV and terminal table\nStep 1: Collect Product Data\nWe'll use the Yiwugo Scraper on Apify to gather...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"price-comparator","url":"https://github.com/ayoubbahssou/price-comparator","description":"price-comparator\nPublic\na web app that allows its users to search the price of a cerrtain product offered by multiple suppliers\nCode\nreadme.md\npricomp\na price comparator that allows its users to search the price of products offered by multiple suppliers it collects data from 3 different sources:\nweb scraping\nit scaps data from morrocan web sites:microchoix.ma,and jumia.ma ##amazon API to get products from amazon.com ##local...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Best-Price-Comparison-Tool","url":"https://github.com/pricecomparison/Best-Price-Comparison-Tool","description":"pricecomparison</td></tr>\n<tr><td>README.md</td><td>README.md</td><td>Initial commit</td><td></...\nThe best price comparison engine that sits neatly in the corner of your browser, scouring the web for the best possible deal based on which product you are looking at. As you browse through Amazon and navigate to any product page, the widget will automatically search through other sellers of the same product and pull up a menu of price results.","siteName":""},{"title":"BargainBuddy – Base v1.0.1 Smart Price Comparison and Scraping Engine","url":"https://github.com/prantiksanki/Bargaining-Buddy","description":"It leverages real-time web scraping to fetch pricing from various online retailers and provides structured comparison data, including pricing trends and deal analytics.\nThis project is part of our Software Engineering capstone at UPES.\nTable of Contents\nFeatures\nTech Stack\nArchitecture\nAPI Endpoints\nSetup and Installation\nProject Structure\nContributors\nFuture Plans\nFeatures\nFull-text search for consumer products\nDynamic product categorization using keyword inference\nStealth web scraping using Puppeteer with anti-bot...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Price-Verify","url":"https://github.com/danish7x7/Price-Verify","description":"danish7x7/Price-Verify\nmain\nCode\n<tabl