{"type":"message","id":"4c0d078e","parentId":"a9f2b22a","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:26:29.062Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_annxvgowdx0y_2","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"github \\\"cost breakdown\\\" \\\"BOM\\\" supplier quote procurement open source\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"PowderSense - Bill of Materials (BOM)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/me-processware/powdersense/blob/master/docs/BOM.md\",\n      \"description\": \"fef2333 · Nov 21, 2025\\n392 lines (278 loc) · 13.4 KB\\nPowderSense - Bill of Materials (BOM)\\nProject: PowderSense Precision Measurement System\\nDesigner: Processware\\nVersion: 1.0\\nLast Updated: November 2025\\nCurrency: EUR (€)\\n📋 Complete Parts List\\nThis document lists all components required to build...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Tracking Cost Differences Between BOM Revisions with OpenBOM\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.openbom.com/blog/tracking-cost-differences-between-bom-revisions-with-openbom\",\n      \"description\": \"That includes the unit cost of each item, any calculated values (such as extended or rolled-up cost), and the total BOM cost at that point in time.With a simple click, you can compare two revisions side-by-side and instantly spot the differences—both in structure and cost. Did someone change the part? Was a cheaper or more expensive component used? Did a supplier update their price?\\nInstead of digging through spreadsheets or emailing for updates, you get immediate answers.\\nReady...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Add Design for Manufacturing (DFM) Agent for Production Optimization #68\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/circuit-synth/circuit-synth/issues/68\",\n      \"description\": \"Add Design for Manufacturing (DFM) Agent for Production Optimization #68\\nLabels\\nenhancement\\nDescription\\nshanemmattner\\nSummary\\nCreate a specialized agent focused on Design for Manufacturing (DFM) analysis to optimize circuit designs for cost-effective, reliable production.\\nBackground\\nDesign for Manufacturing (DFM) is critical for successful product commercialization. Component Selection Optimization - Real DigiKey pricing integration\\nPCB Manufacturing Analysis - Technology mix assessment, complexity scoring\\nAssembly Process Optimization -...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Deeptech founders' guide to contract manufacturer cost modeling and avoiding black-box quotes\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.glencoyne.com/guides/contract-manufacturer-cost-modeling\",\n      \"description\": \" It is dominated by the Bill of Materials (BOM), which is the itemized list of all raw components. The other major piece is the “conversion cost,” which includes the direct labor for assembly and testing, plus a portion of the...\\nStep 1: Estimate Your Bill of Materials (BOM) Cost\\nThe BOM is typically the largest cost driver. For most electronics, the Bill of Materials accounts for 60-80% of the total per-unit cost. \",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Bill of Materials (BOM) and Cost Structure Analysis\",\n      \"url\": \"https://umbrex.com/resources/industry-analyses/how-to-analyze-a-manufacturing-company/bill-of-materials-bom-and-cost-structure-analysis/\",\n      \"description\": \"Supplier Information: Data on suppliers for each material or component, including pricing, delivery times, and any volume discounts.\\nInventory Levels: Current inventory data on raw materials and components.\\nWaste and Scrap Rates: The amount of material lost due to production inefficiencies or defects.\\nProduction Process Data: Information on the production steps involved in assembling the final product, including cycle times and machine usage.\\nDetailed step-by-step instruction on how to conduct the analysis:\\nCreate a Detailed BOM...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"soil-moisture-sensor/bom.txt at master · darconeous/soil-moisture-sensor · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/darconeous/soil-moisture-sensor/blob/master/bom.txt\",\n      \"description\": \"Code\\n78 lines (60 loc) · 2.5 KB\\n## Bill of Materials ## Desc: 4.5\\\"^2 Circuit Board Count: 1 Cost@1x: USD$21.25 Cost@25x: USD$5.00 Cost@Mass: USD$0.54 Source: http://www.goldphoenixpcb.biz/ Source: http://batchpcb.com/ Desc: ATtiny2...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"DIY UPS for Home Assistant Green & Xfinity XB7 Mod\",\n      \"url\": \"https://hackaday.io/project/205125-diy-ups-for-home-assistant-green-xfinity-xb7-mod/\",\n      \"description\": \"md</...\\nCyclenbatt 12V 10Ah LiFePO4 Battery\\n1 ×\\nVictron BatteryProtect BP-65 12/24V\\n1 ×\\nPololu Ideal Diode 4-60V 10A\\n1 ×\\nShelly Plus Uni\\nProject Logs\\nComponents are arriving\\nBill Collis • 03/07/2026 at 19:04 • 0 comments\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenVolts: Cardano-Anchored Energy Pods for Public Spaces\",\n      \"url\": \"https://projectcatalyst.io/funds/14/cardano-use-cases-concepts/openvolts-cardano-anchored-energy-pods-for-public-spaces\",\n      \"description\": \"Telemetry gateway hardware (7×: 5 main...\\nOps, commissioning, signage, field spares: 1,800 ADA\\nOpen-source packaging & community support: 3,200 ADA\\nMRV & security enhancements: 4,000 ADA\\nReference irradiance & weather kit (5 irradiance sensors + 1 compact weather station): 1,600 ADA\\nEnables PR/specific-yield normalization for O&M impact claims.\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Complete Cost Breakdown of Raspberry Pi Models\",\n      \"url\": \"https://linuxhaxor.net/code/raspberry-pi-cost.html\",\n      \"description\": \"Breakdown examples of components costs\\n– Supply Chain Optimization\\nCareful supply chain management has been key to minimizing production overheads for Raspberry Pi Foundation. Some methods include:\\nDirect relationships with electronics contractors to get lowest feasible pricing on chip fabrication, PCB assembly, compliance testing etc.\\nDesign for manufacturability. Common components across models, simplified layouts.\\nLeverage large buyers like RS Components and Farnell/element14 for best component pricing via aggregated orders.\\nSet fixed model...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Does your Contract Manufacturer Need a Bill of Materials (BOM)?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.openbom.com/blog/does-your-contract-manufacturer-need-a-bill-of-materials-bom\",\n      \"description\": \"When a BOM is incomplete or missing, any quotation your CM provides is likely to be inaccurate. This could mean either underestimating costs, leading to unpleasant surprises later when real prices surface, or overestimating to cover potential unknowns, which unnecessarily inflates your budget. Streamlined Procurement\\nOne of the key functions of a BOM is to facilitate procurement. When your CM knows exactly which parts and materials are needed, they can source them more efficiently, reducing the risk of delays due...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"github \"cost breakdown\" \"BOM\" supplier quote procurement open source","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"PowderSense - Bill of Materials (BOM)","url":"https://github.com/me-processware/powdersense/blob/master/docs/BOM.md","description":"fef2333 · Nov 21, 2025\n392 lines (278 loc) · 13.4 KB\nPowderSense - Bill of Materials (BOM)\nProject: PowderSense Precision Measurement System\nDesigner: Processware\nVersion: 1.0\nLast Updated: November 2025\nCurrency: EUR (€)\n📋 Complete Parts List\nThis document lists all components required to build...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Tracking Cost Differences Between BOM Revisions with OpenBOM","url":"https://www.openbom.com/blog/tracking-cost-differences-between-bom-revisions-with-openbom","description":"That includes the unit cost of each item, any calculated values (such as extended or rolled-up cost), and the total BOM cost at that point in time.With a simple click, you can compare two revisions side-by-side and instantly spot the differences—both in structure and cost. Did someone change the part? Was a cheaper or more expensive component used? Did a supplier update their price?\nInstead of digging through spreadsheets or emailing for updates, you get immediate answers.\nReady...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Add Design for Manufacturing (DFM) Agent for Production Optimization #68","url":"https://github.com/circuit-synth/circuit-synth/issues/68","description":"Add Design for Manufacturing (DFM) Agent for Production Optimization #68\nLabels\nenhancement\nDescription\nshanemmattner\nSummary\nCreate a specialized agent focused on Design for Manufacturing (DFM) analysis to optimize circuit designs for cost-effective, reliable production.\nBackground\nDesign for Manufacturing (DFM) is critical for successful product commercialization. Component Selection Optimization - Real DigiKey pricing integration\nPCB Manufacturing Analysis - Technology mix assessment, complexity scoring\nAssembly Process Optimization -...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Deeptech founders' guide to contract manufacturer cost modeling and avoiding black-box quotes","url":"https://www.glencoyne.com/guides/contract-manufacturer-cost-modeling","description":" It is dominated by the Bill of Materials (BOM), which is the itemized list of all raw components. The other major piece is the “conversion cost,” which includes the direct labor for assembly and testing, plus a portion of the...\nStep 1: Estimate Your Bill of Materials (BOM) Cost\nThe BOM is typically the largest cost driver. For most electronics, the Bill of Materials accounts for 60-80% of the total per-unit cost. ","siteName":""},{"title":"Bill of Materials (BOM) and Cost Structure Analysis","url":"https://umbrex.com/resources/industry-analyses/how-to-analyze-a-manufacturing-company/bill-of-materials-bom-and-cost-structure-analysis/","description":"Supplier Information: Data on suppliers for each material or component, including pricing, delivery times, and any volume discounts.\nInventory Levels: Current inventory data on raw materials and components.\nWaste and Scrap Rates: The amount of material lost due to production inefficiencies or defects.\nProduction Process Data: Information on the production steps involved in assembling the final product, including cycle times and machine usage.\nDetailed step-by-step instruction on how to conduct the analysis:\nCreate a Detailed BOM...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"soil-moisture-sensor/bom.txt at master · darconeous/soil-moisture-sensor · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/darconeous/soil-moisture-sensor/blob/master/bom.txt","description":"Code\n78 lines (60 loc) · 2.5 KB\n## Bill of Materials ## Desc: 4.5\"^2 Circuit Board Count: 1 Cost@1x: USD$21.25 Cost@25x: USD$5.00 Cost@Mass: USD$0.54 Source: http://www.goldphoenixpcb.biz/ Source: http://batchpcb.com/ Desc: ATtiny2...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"DIY UPS for Home Assistant Green & Xfinity XB7 Mod","url":"https://hackaday.io/project/205125-diy-ups-for-home-assistant-green-xfinity-xb7-mod/","description":"md</...\nCyclenbatt 12V 10Ah LiFePO4 Battery\n1 ×\nVictron BatteryProtect BP-65 12/24V\n1 ×\nPololu Ideal Diode 4-60V 10A\n1 ×\nShelly Plus Uni\nProject Logs\nComponents are arriving\nBill Collis • 03/07/2026 at 19:04 • 0 comments","siteName":""},{"title":"OpenVolts: Cardano-Anchored Energy Pods for Public Spaces","url":"https://projectcatalyst.io/funds/14/cardano-use-cases-concepts/openvolts-cardano-anchored-energy-pods-for-public-spaces","description":"Telemetry gateway hardware (7×: 5 main...\nOps, commissioning, signage, field spares: 1,800 ADA\nOpen-source packaging & community support: 3,200 ADA\nMRV & security enhancements: 4,000 ADA\nReference irradiance & weather kit (5 irradiance sensors + 1 compact weather station): 1,600 ADA\nEnables PR/specific-yield normalization for O&M impact claims.\n","siteName":""},{"title":"The Complete Cost Breakdown of Raspberry Pi Models","url":"https://linuxhaxor.net/code/raspberry-pi-cost.html","description":"Breakdown examples of components costs\n– Supply Chain Optimization\nCareful supply chain management has been key to minimizing production overheads for Raspberry Pi Foundation. Some methods include:\nDirect relationships with electronics contractors to get lowest feasible pricing on chip fabrication, PCB assembly, compliance testing etc.\nDesign for manufacturability. Common components across models, simplified layouts.\nLeverage large buyers like RS Components and Farnell/element14 for best component pricing via aggregated orders.\nSet fixed model...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Does your Contract Manufacturer Need a Bill of Materials (BOM)?","url":"https://www.openbom.com/blog/does-your-contract-manufacturer-need-a-bill-of-materials-bom","description":"When a BOM is incomplete or missing, any quotation your CM provides is likely to be inaccurate. This could mean either underestimating costs, leading to unpleasant surprises later when real prices surface, or overestimating to cover potential unknowns, which unnecessarily inflates your budget. Streamlined Procurement\nOne of the key functions of a BOM is to facilitate procurement. When your CM knows exactly which parts and materials are needed, they can source them more efficiently, reducing the risk of delays due...\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776212789019}}
{"type":"message","id":"dc98cf4a","parentId":"4c0d078e","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:26:52.236Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent findings! Let me now update the research report with the GitHub tools found. Key discoveries:\n\n1. **omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper** - THE BEST FINDING! This is a free API (5,000 requests/month free) that scrapes Alibaba/1688 with 30+ data points per product including volume pricing, MOQ, supplier verification, specs. This is PERFECT for what 小柱 needs.\n\n2. **DataFlow Procurement Software** - RFQ management, supplier quote comparison, KPI tracking\n\n3. **ProcureFlow-AI** - AI-powered RFP generation from chat\n\n4. **Alibaba RFQ Scraper** - Scrapes Alibaba RFQ listings\n\n\n5. **OpenProcurement** - Open source e-procurement toolkit\n\n6. **ERPNext** - Open source ERP with RFQ and supplier quotation management\n\nNow I need to update the research report with these findings."},{"type":"text","text":"找到了几个重量级GitHub工具！立刻更新调研报告：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_b3z4fte05h5d_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"kb/采购成本底线参考系统调研报告.md","edits":[{"oldText":"## 七、1688官方资源（核心！）\n\n### 7.1 1688 ClawHub 官方技能市场\n**地址**：https://clawhub.1688.com/","newText":"## 七、GitHub开源工具（重要补充！）\n\n### 7.1 核心工具：omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper ⭐⭐⭐\n**GitHub**：https://github.com/omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper\n**免费额度**：5,000 requests/month\n**数据量**：30+数据点/商品\n\n**核心功能**：\n- 商品搜索（关键词）\n- 批发价格分层（volume pricing tiers）\n- 最小起订量（MOQ）\n- 供应商资质验证（Gold Supplier、Trade Assurance）\n- 完整供应商档案（评分、工厂规模）\n- SKU变体分组\n- 完整规格参数\n\n**输出格式**：结构化JSON，直接可用\n\n```json\n{\n  \"product_id\": \"1601216646059\",\n  \"price_tiers\": [...],\n  \"moq\": 12,\n  \"supplier\": {\n    \"name\": \"...\",\n    \"verified\": true,\n    \"gold_supplier\": true,\n    \"trade_assurance\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**安装**：`pip install alibaba-scraper` 或 `npm install alibaba-scraper`\n\n### 7.2 采购管理工具\n\n| 工具 | GitHub | 功能 | 特点 |\n|------|--------|------|------|\n| **DataFlow** | https://github.com/sorguido/dataflow-procurement-software | RFQ管理、供应商比价、KPI追踪 | 桌面应用，采购部门专用 |\n| **ProcureFlow-AI** | https://github.com/Rakesh-honawad/ProcureFlow-AI | AI生成RFP/RFQ文档 | 输入需求→AI生成询价采购文档 |\n| **Alibaba RFQ Scraper** | https://github.com/Aadesh1106/alibaba-rfq-scraper | 抓取Alibaba UAE RFQ数据 | Selenium驱动 |\n| **ERPNext** | https://erpnext.com | RFQ+供应商报价单+采购订单 | 开源ERP，完整P2P流程 |\n| **OpenProcurement** | https://openprocurement.org | 开源采购工具包 | 透明招标，拍卖驱动 |\n\n### 7.3 比价与价格追踪\n\n| 工具 | GitHub | 功能 | 特点 |\n|------|--------|------|------|\n| **price-comparator** | https://github.com/ayoubbahssou/price-comparator | 多供应商价格对比 | Web应用，支持网页爬取+API |\n| **BargainBuddy** | https://github.com/prantiksanki/Bargaining-Buddy | 实时爬取多平台价格+趋势分析 | Puppeteer驱动，反爬规避 |\n| **1688 Scraper API** | https://github.com/oxylabs/1688-scraper | 1688实时数据提取 | 商业API，免费试用 |\n| **scraper-bank** | https://github.com/scraper-bank/Alibaba.com-Scrapers | Alibaba全站爬虫（Python/Node.js） | 生产级，多框架 |\n\n---\n\n## 八、1688官方资源（核心！）\n\n### 8.1 1688 ClawHub 官方技能市场\n**地址**：https://clawhub.1688.com/"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776212789065,"responseId":"062e0e35abd6495f5c9d1f85d1f653bc"}}
{"type":"message","id":"43c652ab","parentId":"dc98cf4a","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:26:52.373Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_b3z4fte05h5d_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced 1 block(s) in kb/采购成本底线参考系统调研报告.md."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n 200 3. **逐步沉淀私有数据**：每次采购后记录实际成交价→形成德胧专属价格库\n 201 \n 202 ---\n 203 \n-204 ## 七、1688官方资源（核心！）\n+204 ## 七、GitHub开源工具（重要补充！）\n 205 \n-206 ### 7.1 1688 ClawHub 官方技能市场\n+206 ### 7.1 核心工具：omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper ⭐⭐⭐\n+207 **GitHub**：https://github.com/omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper\n+208 **免费额度**：5,000 requests/month\n+209 **数据量**：30+数据点/商品\n+210 \n+211 **核心功能**：\n+212 - 商品搜索（关键词）\n+213 - 批发价格分层（volume pricing tiers）\n+214 - 最小起订量（MOQ）\n+215 - 供应商资质验证（Gold Supplier、Trade Assurance）\n+216 - 完整供应商档案（评分、工厂规模）\n+217 - SKU变体分组\n+218 - 完整规格参数\n+219 \n+220 **输出格式**：结构化JSON，直接可用\n+221 \n+222 ```json\n+223 {\n+224   \"product_id\": \"1601216646059\",\n+225   \"price_tiers\": [...],\n+226   \"moq\": 12,\n+227   \"supplier\": {\n+228     \"name\": \"...\",\n+229     \"verified\": true,\n+230     \"gold_supplier\": true,\n+231     \"trade_assurance\": true\n+232   }\n+233 }\n+234 ```\n+235 \n+236 **安装**：`pip install alibaba-scraper` 或 `npm install alibaba-scraper`\n+237 \n+238 ### 7.2 采购管理工具\n+239 \n+240 | 工具 | GitHub | 功能 | 特点 |\n+241 |------|--------|------|------|\n+242 | **DataFlow** | https://github.com/sorguido/dataflow-procurement-software | RFQ管理、供应商比价、KPI追踪 | 桌面应用，采购部门专用 |\n+243 | **ProcureFlow-AI** | https://github.com/Rakesh-honawad/ProcureFlow-AI | AI生成RFP/RFQ文档 | 输入需求→AI生成询价采购文档 |\n+244 | **Alibaba RFQ Scraper** | https://github.com/Aadesh1106/alibaba-rfq-scraper | 抓取Alibaba UAE RFQ数据 | Selenium驱动 |\n+245 | **ERPNext** | https://erpnext.com | RFQ+供应商报价单+采购订单 | 开源ERP，完整P2P流程 |\n+246 | **OpenProcurement** | https://openprocurement.org | 开源采购工具包 | 透明招标，拍卖驱动 |\n+247 \n+248 ### 7.3 比价与价格追踪\n+249 \n+250 | 工具 | GitHub | 功能 | 特点 |\n+251 |------|--------|------|------|\n+252 | **price-comparator** | https://github.com/ayoubbahssou/price-comparator | 多供应商价格对比 | Web应用，支持网页爬取+API |\n+253 | **BargainBuddy** | https://github.com/prantiksanki/Bargaining-Buddy | 实时爬取多平台价格+趋势分析 | Puppeteer驱动，反爬规避 |\n+254 | **1688 Scraper API** | https://github.com/oxylabs/1688-scraper | 1688实时数据提取 | 商业API，免费试用 |\n+255 | **scraper-bank** | https://github.com/scraper-bank/Alibaba.com-Scrapers | Alibaba全站爬虫（Python/Node.js） | 生产级，多框架 |\n+256 \n+257 ---\n+258 \n+259 ## 八、1688官方资源（核心！）\n+260 \n+261 ### 8.1 1688 ClawHub 官方技能市场\n 207 **地址**：https://clawhub.1688.com/\n 208 \n 209 | Skill名称 | 功能 | 下载量 | 安装量 |\n 210 |-----------|------|--------|--------|\n     ...","firstChangedLine":204},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776212812307}}
