ults / 40K protected results\\nEverything from Developer plan\\n50 concurrent requests\\nChat support\\nper billing period\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"omkarcloud alibaba-scraper pricing plans beyond free tier 5000 requests","provider":"miaoda","count":10,"results":[{"title":"Alibaba Scraper API","url":"https://github.com/omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper","description":"Alibaba Scraper API\nSearch Alibaba...\nGet 30+ data points per product (volume pricing tiers, MOQ, supplier verification, variants, specs)\nFull supplier profiles with Gold Supplier status, Trade Assurance, ratings, facility size\nSKU variant groups with swatch images and combination mapping\n5,000 requests/month on free tier\nExample Response:\n{\n    \"product_id\": \"1601216646059\",\n","siteName":""},{"title":"alibaba-scraper-api","url":"https://github.com/topics/alibaba-scraper-api","description":"omkarcloud / alibaba-scraper\nSearch Alibaba products, get volume pricing tiers, supplier verification, MOQs, and full product specs — all via a single API call. Real-time data, structured JSON. **5,000 free requests/month.**\nsuppliers alibaba alicloud price-scraper e-commerce-api aliexpress-api aliexpress-scraper price-scraping scraper-api alibaba-scraper alibaba-api alibaba-scraper-api...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Alibaba Scraper API","url":"https://www.parseium.com/scrapers/alibaba-scraper-api","description":"Alibaba Scraper API\nExtract supplier data, product listings, prices, and company information from Alibaba with our powerful scraper API. Get structured, type-safe data with millisecond response times and built-in proxy management.\nJust provide a URL and we'll create a custom high-speed parser just for you. Or choose one of our ready-to-use parsers.\n<beginning of the code>\ncurl -X POST  'https://api.parseium.com/v1/scrape/id...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Alibaba Scraper","url":"https://www.nimbleway.com/nimble-api/ecommerce/alibaba","description":"Nimble’s E-commerce API\nAlibaba Scraper\nStreamline your bulk product sourcing with our Alibaba Scraper, specifically engineered for capturing detailed supplier information, bulk pricing, product specifications, and buyer reviews.\nHigher perfomance\nNimble AI optimizes for\nspeed-sensitive applications with high-performance IPs\nRock-solid stability\nget IPs with exceptional stability to support long-running tasks\nFlawless reputation\nhard-to-access URLs automatically get IPs with proven track records...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Alibaba Product Scraper","url":"https://apify.com/cloud9_ai/alibaba-scraper","description":"cloud9\nMaintained by Community\nActor stats\n0 Bookmarked\n2 Total users\n1...\nIf you encounter persistent blocking, try reducing <beginning of the code>maxConcurrency<end of the code> or adding delays between requests.\nPricing\n$5.00 per 1,000 items scraped.\nNotes\nAlibaba search results typically show ~48 products per page\nThe scraper handles both SSR HTML parsing and embedded JSON data extraction\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Become a sponsor to omkarcloud","url":"https://github.com/sponsors/omkarcloud","description":"omkarcloud\nHi folks! 👋 Thank you for checking us out!\nOmkar Cloud creates developer tools, extractors, libraries, and frameworks to simplify development for developers.\n⚡️ Projects\nHere’s one of our most popular open-source projects...\nSelect a tier\n$\none time\nChoose a custom amount.\n$28 one time\nGoogle Maps Scraper Pro [Deprecated] Kindly purchase from http://omkar.cloud/tools/google-maps-extractor/about","siteName":""},{"title":"网络爬虫API | Oxylabs","url":"https://oxylabs.cn/products/scraper-api/web","description":"节省时间和开发成本\n最多622,500个结果\n其他：$1.15/1K结果\n亚马逊：$0.45/1K结果\n谷歌：$0.90/1K结果\n其他：$1.10/1K结果\n谷歌：$0.80/1K结果\n其他：$0.95/1K结果...\n$1.25 / 每千个结果\n","siteName":""},{"title":"Home","url":"https://www.omkar.cloud/","description":"We offer a generous free tier for every tool and a 90-day refund policy.\n3. Trustworthy\nWe're