{"type":"message","id":"a120c984","parentId":"da2fa567","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:34:29.111Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both browsers are unavailable. Let me try to fetch the 1688 API documentation page to understand the API registration process better, and then guide the user through the steps manually.\n\nActually, based on my research, I found that:\n1. For 1688 Open Platform, you can register and get a test key immediately, but to apply for official APIs you need 1-2 working days review\n2. For \"自用型应用\" (self-use application), there's a simpler process\n\nLet me fetch the 1688 dev page to see if I can extract any useful information."},{"type":"text","text":"浏览器环境不可用。但我已经从搜索中找到了关键信息，直接给你最可行的方案：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_febxo7mmidel_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://open.1688.com/dev.htm","maxChars":5000}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_febxo7mmidel_2","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"1688开放平台 自用型应用 appkey appsecret 立即获取 测试"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776213262561,"responseId":"062e100e3b207e67454e8fb5294e783f"}}
