{"type":"message","id":"524dcb89","parentId":"c3a91879","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:51:14.687Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_pblg8m0kw8fs_2","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"omkarcloud alibaba-scraper install github pip install\",\n  \"provider\": \"miaoda\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Alibaba Scraper API\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper\",\n      \"description\": \"Search Alibaba products, get volume pricing tiers, supplier verification, MOQs, and full product specs — all via a single API call. Real-time data, structured JSON. **5,000 free requests/month.**\\nCode\\nFolders and files\\n<table>\\n<tr><th>Name</th> <th>Name</th> <th>Last commit message</th> <th>Last commit date</th></tr>\\n<tr><td>\\nChetan11...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"🤖 Botasaurus 🤖\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.org/omkarcloud/botasaurus\",\n      \"description\": \"Step 1: Install Botasaurus\\nFirst things first, you need to install Botasaurus. Run the following command in your terminal:\\npython -m pip install --upgrade botasaurus\\nStep 2: Set Up Your Botasaurus Project\\nNext, let's set up the project:\\nCreate a directory for your Botasaurus project and navigate into it:\\nbrowser import browser, Driver\\n\\n\\n\\n@browser\\n\\n\\ndef scrape_heading_task(driver: Driver, data):\\n...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How to run Pip commands from CMD\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.alibabacloud.com/topic-center/dev-faq/ghgfdxwcd2-how-to-run-pip-commands-from-cmd\",\n      \"description\": \"Using Pip Commands from CMD\\nOnce Pip is installed, you can use it to install packages from the Python Package Index. To use Pip commands from the Command Prompt (CMD), you must first open the CMD window. To open the CMD window, press the Windows key + R, type cmd, and press Enter. Once the CMD window is open, you can use the following commands to manage Python packages:\\npip install - This command will install the package with the specified name.\\npip...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - poneoneo/Alibaba-CLI-Scraper: Create your own Alibaba dataset and interact with it in plain English. · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/poneoneo/Alibaba-CLI-Scraper\",\n      \"description\": \"<beginning of the code>pipx<end of the code> installs the package, exposes his CLI() entrypoints in an isolated environment and makes it available everywhere in your system. This guarantees no dependency conflicts and clean uninstall. let's install <beginning of the code>aba-cli-scrapper<end of the code> using pipx:\\nInstall pipx with a python 3.11 or higher version:\\npython/python3 -m pip install --user pipx\\n...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - ScrapingAnt/alibaba_scraper: Alibaba scraper with using of rotating proxies and headless Chrome from ScrapingAnt · GitHub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/scrapingant/alibaba_scraper\",\n      \"description\": \"Code\\n<table>\\n<tr><td>\\nmegabotan</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>.gitignore</td><td>.gitignore</td><td>added data folder creation</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>Dockerfile</td><td>Dockerfile</td><td>initial commit</td><td></td></tr>\\n<tr><td>README.md</td><td>README.md</td><td>issue4...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"ali2b-cli-scrapper 1.0.1\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pypi.org/project/ali2b-cli-scrapper/\",\n      \"description\": \"Alibaba-CLI-Scraper\\nIs a python package that provides a dedicated CLI interface for scraping data from Alibaba.com. The purpose of this project is to extract products and theirs...\\nInstall tool from pypi: to avoid any issues, with other packages or depencies installed in your machine, this tool should be installed with pipx to create isolated environments before to run it:\\npipx install ali2b-cli-scrapper\\nBehind the Scene: How I Tackled Web Scraping Challenges\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"aba-cli-scrapper\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.piwheels.org/project/aba-cli-scrapper/\",\n      \"description\": \"aba-cli-scrapper\\nCreate your own Alibaba dataset and interact with it in plain English.\\nInstallation\\nIn a virtualenv (see these instructions if you need to create one ):\\npip3 install aba-cli-scrapper\\nDependencies\\nrequests\\ncryptography\\ncharset-normalizer\\nattrs\\naiosignal\\nfrozenlist\\nmdurl\\ncolorama\\npackaging\\nplotnine\\nurllib3\\nloguru\\npython-dotenv\\npyee\\ndatahorse\\npydantic\\n...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Alibaba Scraper\",\n      \"url\": \"https://apify.com/lexis-solutions/alibaba-scraper/api/python\",\n      \"description\": \"Alibaba Scraper\\nlexis-solutions/alibaba-scraper\\nThe Apify Alibaba Scraper is an efficient web crawling tool designed to scrape Alibaba, extracting product information, prices, and reviews. This crawler streamlines data collection by quickly crawling and scraping content, providing valuable insights for research and analysis.\\nPricing\\n$30.00/month + usage\\nRating\\n5.0\\nDeveloper\\nLexis Solutions\\nMaintained by Community...\\n$pip install apify-client\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"aba-cli-scrapper 0.7.6\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pypi.org/project/aba-cli-scrapper/\",\n      \"description\": \"Install pipx with a python 3.11 or higher version:\\npython/python3 -m pip install --user pipx\\nadd pipx to your PATH:\\npipx ensurepath\\nInstall <beginning of the code>aba-cli-scrapper<end of the code> using pipx:\\npipx install aba-cli-scrapper\\nand you're ready to use <beginning of the code>aba-cli-scrapper<end of the code> !\\nIf you'd...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"GitHub - jinut2/alibaba-scraper: