{"type":"message","id":"f3f6e128","parentId":"524dcb89","timestamp":"2026-04-15T00:51:26.816Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found several important things:\n\n1. **omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper** - This is not a pip package, it's a GitHub project that uses **Botasaurus** (a web scraping framework). You install it via `git clone` and it requires `botasaurus`.\n\n2. **aba-cli-scrapper** (ali2b-cli-scrapper) - This IS on PyPI and provides a CLI interface for Alibaba scraping. This might be easier to install!\n\n3. **Alibaba-CLI-Scraper** by poneoneo - Similar CLI tool\n\nLet me also check the OpenClaw browser configuration, and then try installing the CLI scraper tools."},{"type":"text","text":"发现！omkarcloud用到了Botasaurus框架，需要先装依赖。让我同时研究OpenClaw的浏览器配置：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4pqnvrs9xwcx_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install botasaurus 2>&1 | tail -10","timeout":60}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4pqnvrs9xwcx_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pipx install ali2b-cli-scrapper 2>&1 || pip install ali2b-cli-scrapper 2>&1 | tail -10","timeout":60}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4pqnvrs9xwcx_3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(json.dumps(d.get('browser', d.get('chromium', {})), indent=2))\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"Config not readable\"","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776214274701,"responseId":"062e14022464aaa6ad37429a904ea829"}}
