{"type":"message","id":"93578c68","parentId":"6eefe901","timestamp":"2026-04-15T01:31:23.742Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand! The omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper is actually a hosted API service, not a local scraper. You need to:\n1. Create an account at omkar.cloud\n2. Get an API key\n3. Use their API endpoint with the key\n\nSo it's NOT a local deployment - it's a hosted API. But the data shows they have a Python SDK approach too.\n\nFor truly local scraping, I should look at the `ali2b-cli-scrapper` package that I found earlier, which is a CLI tool installed via pipx.\n\nLet me also check if ali2b-cli-scrapper can work without the mysql dependency issue, or if there are other truly local options.\n\n\nLooking back at what I found, the ali2b-cli-scrapper package requires pipx and has dependency issues, while omkarcloud is a hosted API. The scraper-bank/Alibaba.com-Scrapers repo is just basic web scraping code, not a proper API. For local deployment, I could go with direct Playwright or Selenium scraping, though that requires more setup. Let me check what's actually in the alibaba-scraper directory I already have - it looks like just a README and image, so I need to examine what scraper-bank actually provides."},{"type":"text","text":"明白了！omkarcloud是**云端API服务**（需要注册获取Key），不是本地工具。让我找一个真正本地的替代方案：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_u0dv1qxzx8b9_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install requests 2>&1 | tail -3 && pip install playwright 2>&1 | tail -3","timeout":60}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_u0dv1qxzx8b9_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /tmp && git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/scraper-bank/Alibaba.com-Scrapers.git 2>&1 | tail -5","timeout":60,"background":true}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":