{"type":"message","id":"d30b0e7b","parentId":"94f926c5","timestamp":"2026-04-15T01:32:43.042Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, there are Playwright and Selenium versions available. Let me check the playwright version for product search which would be better for our needs."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_55albt1kao29_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /tmp/Alibaba.com-Scrapers/python/playwright/ && cat /tmp/Alibaba.com-Scrapers/python/playwright/README.md | head -60","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776216758028,"responseId":"062e1db6db09a6326105d98061fb1913"}}
{"type":"message","id":"bae2778c","parentId":"d30b0e7b","timestamp":"2026-04-15T01:32:43.174Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_55albt1kao29_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"product_category\nproduct_data\nproduct_search\nREADME.md\n# Alibaba Scrapers - Playwright (Python)\n\nEffortlessly extract high-quality product data, search results, and category listings from Alibaba using these robust Python scrapers powered by Playwright. This suite provides a scalable solution for navigating Alibaba's dynamic content while leveraging advanced browser automation to ensure data accuracy.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis directory contains Python scrapers built with **Playwright**.\n\n## Available Scrapers\n\n- [Product Category](./product_category/README.md)\n- [Product Data](./product_data/README.md)\n- [Product Search](./product_search/README.md)\n\n## Why Playwright?\n\nPlaywright is a modern, high-performance browser automation library that is ideally suited for scraping complex, JavaScript-heavy websites like Alibaba. Unlike traditional HTTP clients, Playwright renders the full DOM, allowing it to interact with elements that only appear after user interaction or asynchronous data loading.\n\n**Key features and capabilities:**\n- **Auto-waiting Logic:** Playwright automatically waits for elements to be actionable, significantly reducing flakiness caused by slow network requests.\n- **Headless & Headed Modes:** Run scrapers invisibly for performance or in headed mode for debugging and visual verification.\n- **Context Isolation:** Create isolated browser contexts to manage cookies and sessions efficiently without the overhead of multiple browser instances.\n- **Performance:** Playwright is generally faster and more reliable than Selenium, offering native support for modern web features and better handling of asynchronous events.\n- **When to use:** Choose this stack when scraping Alibaba pages where data is injected via React/Vue, or when you need to bypass simple bot detection that targets non-browser clients.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- **Python**: Python 3.7 or higher\n- **pip**: pip\n- **ScrapeOps API Key**: For anti-bot protection (free tier available)\n\n## Installation\n\n1. Navigate to the specific scraper directory:\n```bash\ncd product_category  # or product_data, product_search\n```\n\n2. Install dependencies:\n```bash\npip install playwright beautifulsoup4\nplaywright install chromium\n```\n\n3. Get your ScrapeOps API key from [https://scrapeops.io/app/register/ai-scraper](https://scrapeops.io/app/register/ai-scraper)\n\n4. Update the API key in the scraper file:\n```python\nAPI_KEY = 'YOUR-API-KEY'\n```\n\n## Anti-Bot Protection\n\nAll scrapers can integrate with **ScrapeOps** to help handle Alibaba's anti-bot measures:\n- Proxy rotation (may help reduce IP blocking)\n- Request header optimization (can help reduce detection)\n- Rate limiting management\n\n**Note**: Anti-bot measures vary by site and may change over time. CAPTCHA challenges may occur and cannot be guaranteed to be resolved automatically. Using proxies and browser automation can help reduce blocking, but effectiveness depends on the target site's specific anti-bot measures."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":15,"aggregated":"product_category\nproduct_data\nproduct_search\nREADME.md\n# Alibaba Scrapers - Playwright (Python)\n\nEffortlessly extract high-quality product data, search results, and category listings from Alibaba using these robust Python scrapers powered by Playwright. This suite provides a scalable solution for navigating Alibaba's dynamic content while leveraging advanced browser automation to ensure data accuracy.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis directory contains Python scrapers built with **Playwright**.\n\n## Available Scrapers\n\n- [Product Category](./product_category/README.md)\n- [Product Data](./product_data/README.md)\n- [Product Search](./product_search/README.md)\n\n## Why Playwright?\n\nPlaywright is a modern, high-performance browser automation library that is ideally suited for scraping complex, JavaScript-heavy websites like Alibaba. Unlike traditional HTTP clients, Playwright renders the full DOM, allowing it to interact with elements that only appear after user interaction or asynchronous data loading.\n\n**Key features and capabilities:**\n- **Auto-waiting Logic:** Playwright automatically waits for elements to be actionable, significantly reducing flakiness caused by slow network requests.\n- **Headless & Headed Modes:** Run scrapers invisibly for performance or in headed mode for debugging and visual verification.\n- **Context Isolation:** Create isolated browser contexts to manage cookies and sessions efficiently without the overhead of multiple browser instances.\n- **Performance:** Playwright is generally faster and more reliable than Selenium, offering native support for modern web features and better handling of asynchronous events.\n- **When to use:** Choose this stack when scraping Alibaba pages where data is injected via React/Vue, or when you need to bypass simple bot detection that targets non-browser clients.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- **Python**: Python 3.7 or higher\n- **pip**: pip\n- **ScrapeOps API Key**: For anti-bot protection (free tier available)\n\n## Installation\n\n1. Navigate to the specific scraper directory:\n```bash\ncd product_category  # or product_data, product_search\n```\n\n2. Install dependencies:\n```bash\npip install playwright beautifulsoup4\nplaywright install chromium\n```\n\n3. Get your ScrapeOps API key from [https://scrapeops.io/app/register/ai-scraper](https://scrapeops.io/app/register/ai-scraper)\n\n4. Update the API key in the scraper file:\n```python\nAPI_KEY = 'YOUR-API-KEY'\n```\n\n## Anti-Bot Protection\n\nAll scrapers can integrate with **ScrapeOps** to help handle Alibaba's anti-bot measures:\n- Proxy rotation (may help reduce IP blocking)\n- Request header optimization (can help reduce detection)\n- Rate limiting management\n\n**Note**: Anti-bot measures vary by site and may change over time. CAPTCHA challenges may occur and cannot be guaranteed to be resolved automatically. Using proxies and browser automation can help reduce blocking, but effectiveness depends on the target site's specific anti-bot measures.","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776216763107}}
{"type":"message","id":"8b36b763","parentId":"bae2778c","timestamp":"2026-04-15T01:32:53.413Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the scraper-bank/Alibaba.com-Scrapers which is a proper local tool! But it requires ScrapeOps API key for anti-bot protection. Let me check if we can use it without the key or if there's another approach.\n\nActually, the key insight is:\n1. omkarcloud/alibaba-scraper - cloud API, needs registration, 5000 free req/month\n2. scraper-bank/Alibaba.com-Scrapers - local Python scripts, needs ScrapeOps key for anti-bot\n3. The Python playwright approach needs playwright installed\n\nLet me try to install playwright and the scraper, or alternatively, just write a simple Python script that uses requests to call the 1688 API directly.\n\n\nActually, I think the most pragmatic path forward is to just register for the omkarcloud API key since it's free and gets us up and running quickly, while I work on installing playwright locally for future use."},{"type":"text","text":"找到本地方案了！但需要playwright。让我同时做两件事：注册omkarcloud获取免费Key，同时安装playwright：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sx8zwsy6gpj4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pip install playwright 2>&1 | tail -5","timeout":120,"background":true}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sx8zwsy6gpj4_2","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"start","target":"host","profile":"openclaw"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776216763178,"responseId":"062e1dbbc4583f43dd5947f07df3b1fe"}}
